window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b069-ae928b958600c05a.json"]={sha256:"ae928b958600c05a7c3da2b1f07a6ab677342f2446c57cd3d01cf5ee26f6d9bc",value:{"id":"b069","title":"高強度混凝土高程泵送","titleEn":"High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"超高層核心筒與巨柱的混凝土多以泵送輸送，600 m 的垂直高度本身就產生約 14 MPa 的靜壓，再加上高強度混凝土黏度高造成的管壁摩擦，泵機出口壓力可達 20 至 30 MPa 級。本課以哈里發塔 2008 年 606 m 的垂直泵送紀錄、上海中心大廈約 580 m 的泵送、平安金融中心以 C100 泵送至 555.5 m 等案例，說明壓力組成、潤滑層流變、高壓管與接頭、泵機功率、管線固定、開泵與清管、可泵性試驗、溫度與坍流度監測、磨耗檢測與強度追溯。","summaryEn":"Concrete for supertall cores and megacolumns is mostly pumped; a vertical lift of 600 m alone creates about 14 MPa of static head, and wall friction from viscous high-strength mixes pushes pump outlet pressures into the 20 to 30 MPa range. Using Burj Khalifa's 2008 vertical pumping record of 606 m, pumping to about 580 m at Shanghai Tower and C100 concrete pumped to 555.5 m at Ping An Finance Center, the course covers pressure components, lubrication-layer rheology, high-pressure pipes and couplings, pump power, line fixing, start-up and flushing, pumpability testing, temperature and slump-flow monitoring, wear inspection and strength traceability.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-concrete-steel","subcategoryTitle":"混凝土與鋼構施工技術","subcategoryTitleEn":"Concrete and steel construction technology","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-concrete-steel","learningTags":["structures","st-concrete-steel","concrete"],"architectureFamily":"concrete","architectureNodes":[["高強度混凝土配比","High-strength mix design"],["超高壓泵機與 S 閥","Ultra-high-pressure pump and S-valve"],["高壓輸送管與彎頭","High-pressure line and elbows"],["管線錨座與截止閥","Line anchors and shut-off valve"],["布料機與澆置點","Placing boom and placement point"],["壓力、測厚與澆置紀錄","Pressure, thickness and pour records"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[2,4],[1,5],[2,5],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"concrete","labels":["高強度混凝土配比","超高壓泵機與 S 閥","高壓輸送管與彎頭","管線錨座與截止閥","布料機與澆置點"],"labelsEn":["High-strength mix design","Ultra-high-pressure pump and S-valve","High-pressure line and elbows","Line anchors and shut-off valve","Placing boom and placement point"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"計算練習：以 125 mm 管徑把高強度混凝土泵送到 600 m 高，總管長 700 m、10 個彎管、排量 40 m³/h。靜壓 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa；摩擦梯度由試驗迴路量得 0.0106 MPa/m，700 m 約 7.4 MPa；彎管 1.0 MPa；總泵壓約 22.8 MPa。管內流速 0.0111/0.0123 ≈ 0.91 m/s；水力功率 22.8×10⁶×0.0111 ≈ 253 kW，效率 0.75 時引擎約 338 kW。以 D = 150 mm、容許應力 300 MPa 計，所需壁厚 22.8×150/600 ≈ 5.7 mm，取 10 mm 新管保留磨耗裕度。若為提高強度使界面黏度加倍，摩擦梯度升到 0.0202 MPa/m，總泵壓約 29.5 MPa，功率約 328 kW、引擎約 437 kW，所需壁厚增為約 7.4 mm，磨耗裕度與管件壽命都大幅縮短，可能需要改用接力泵或調整配比。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際專案。","textEn":"Calculation exercise: high-strength concrete is pumped through a 125 mm line to 600 m, with 700 m of line, ten bends and 40 m³/h output. Static head is 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa; the loop-measured friction gradient of 0.0106 MPa/m gives about 7.4 MPa over 700 m; bends add 1.0 MPa; total pressure is about 22.8 MPa. Line velocity is 0.0111/0.0123 ≈ 0.91 m/s; hydraulic power is 22.8×10⁶×0.0111 ≈ 253 kW, about 338 kW of engine at 0.75 efficiency. With D = 150 mm and 300 MPa allowable stress, the required wall is 22.8×150/600 ≈ 5.7 mm, so 10 mm new pipe keeps a wear allowance. If interface viscosity doubles to gain strength, friction rises to 0.0202 MPa/m and total pressure to about 29.5 MPa, power to about 328 kW and engine to about 437 kW, and the required wall to about 7.4 mm, sharply shortening wear allowance and pipe life, so a relay pump or a mix adjustment may be needed. Values are teaching assumptions, not any real project.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b069-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「高程泵送的壓力組成」與「潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Components of high-rise pumping pressure\" and \"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b069-v13-01","title":"高程泵送的壓力組成：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Components of high-rise pumping pressure: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「泵送壓力需求」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pump pressure demand” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"泵機必須提供的壓力由三部分組成：把混凝土柱抬高的靜壓、混凝土沿管壁滑動的摩擦損失，以及彎管、錐形管與閥件的局部損失。對超高層而言，靜壓與高度成正比，600 m 時已經非常可觀；摩擦則與管長、流速、管徑與混凝土流變有關，高強度混凝土的低水膠比與高膠結料量使它更黏，摩擦明顯高於一般混凝土。三者相加決定泵機等級、輸送管壁厚與接頭型式，也決定是否需要在中途設接力泵。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「泵送壓力需求」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The pressure a pump must deliver has three parts: static head to lift the concrete column, friction loss as concrete slides along the pipe wall, and local losses in bends, reducers and valves. In supertall work static head grows linearly with height and is already very large at 600 m; friction depends on line length, velocity, pipe diameter and rheology, and the low water–binder ratio and high binder content of high-strength concrete make it stickier, with markedly higher friction than ordinary concrete. Their sum sets the pump class, pipe wall thickness and coupling type, and decides whether an intermediate relay pump is needed. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pump pressure demand” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「泵送壓力需求」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pump pressure demand”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-01-k1","title":"高程泵送的壓力組成","titleEn":"Components of high-rise pumping pressure","text":"泵機必須提供的壓力由三部分組成：把混凝土柱抬高的靜壓、混凝土沿管壁滑動的摩擦損失，以及彎管、錐形管與閥件的局部損失。對超高層而言，靜壓與高度成正比，600 m 時已經非常可觀；摩擦則與管長、流速、管徑與混凝土流變有關，高強度混凝土的低水膠比與高膠結料量使它更黏，摩擦明顯高於一般混凝土。","textEn":"The pressure a pump must deliver has three parts: static head to lift the concrete column, friction loss as concrete slides along the pipe wall, and local losses in bends, reducers and valves. In supertall work static head grows linearly with height and is already very large at 600 m; friction depends on line length, velocity, pipe diameter and rheology, and the low water–binder ratio and high binder content of high-strength concrete make it stickier, with markedly higher friction than ordinary concrete.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「高程泵送的壓力組成」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Components of high-rise pumping pressure\" is correct?","options":["泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。","泵機必須提供的壓力由三部分組成：把混凝土柱抬高的靜壓、混凝土沿管壁滑動的摩擦損失，以及彎管、錐形管與閥件的局部損失。","坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density.","The pressure a pump must deliver has three parts: static head to lift the concrete column, friction loss as concrete slides along the pipe wall, and local losses in bends, reducers and valves.","The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump."],"answer":1,"explanation":"泵機必須提供的壓力由三部分組成：把混凝土柱抬高的靜壓、混凝土沿管壁滑動的摩擦損失，以及彎管、錐形管與閥件的局部損失。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The pressure a pump must deliver has three parts: static head to lift the concrete column, friction loss as concrete slides along the pipe wall, and local losses in bends, reducers and valves. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b069-v13-02","title":"高程泵送的壓力組成：定量估算","titleEn":"Components of high-rise pumping pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「泵送壓力需求」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pump pressure demand” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local。ρ = 2,450 kg/m³、h = 600 m 時靜壓 = 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa；摩擦梯度 i = 0.010 MPa/m、管長 L = 700 m 得 7.0 MPa；10 個彎管各 0.1 MPa 得 1.0 MPa；合計約 22.4 MPa。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local. With ρ = 2,450 kg/m³ and h = 600 m the static head is 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa; a friction gradient i = 0.010 MPa/m over L = 700 m adds 7.0 MPa; ten bends at 0.1 MPa each add 1.0 MPa; the total is about 22.4 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以泵送計畫書列出最高澆置點的高度、總管長、彎管數與假設摩擦梯度，計算所需泵壓並保留裕度；施工中以泵機壓力紀錄與管線上的壓力感測器比對預測值，並隨樓層升高逐段更新。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: List the highest placement level, total line length, number of bends and assumed friction gradient in the pumping plan, compute the required pressure with a margin, and during construction compare pump pressure logs and in-line pressure sensors with predictions, updating them as the building rises.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local。ρ = 2,450 kg/m³、h = 600 m 時靜壓 = 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa；摩擦梯度 i = 0.010 MPa/m、管長 L = 700 m 得 7.0 MPa；10 個彎管各 0.1 MPa 得 1.0 MPa；合計約 22.4 MPa。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local. With ρ = 2,450 kg/m³ and h = 600 m the static head is 2,450×9.81×600 ≈ 14.4 MPa; a friction gradient i = 0.010 MPa/m over L = 700 m adds 7.0 MPa; ten bends at 0.1 MPa each add 1.0 MPa; the total is about 22.4 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「高程泵送的壓力組成」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Components of high-rise pumping pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。","泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local。"],"optionsEn":["A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time.","Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local."],"answer":2,"explanation":"p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"p = ρgh + i·L + Σp_local. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b069-v13-03","title":"高程泵送的壓力組成：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Components of high-rise pumping pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「泵送壓力需求」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pump pressure demand” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以泵送計畫書列出最高澆置點的高度、總管長、彎管數與假設摩擦梯度，計算所需泵壓並保留裕度；施工中以泵機壓力紀錄與管線上的壓力感測器比對預測值，並隨樓層升高逐段更新。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"List the highest placement level, total line length, number of bends and assumed friction gradient in the pumping plan, compute the required pressure with a margin, and during construction compare pump pressure logs and in-line pressure sensors with predictions, updating them as the building rises. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：泵送計畫要在每一個關鍵高程（例如每 100 m）重新計算泵壓與裕度，並明訂超過某壓力即需改配比、換管或設接力泵的決策點，由泵送工程師與混凝土供應商共同簽認。","observationEn":"Site practice: Recalculate pressure and margin at each key level, for example every 100 m, and set decision points at which a mix change, new pipes or a relay pump is triggered above a given pressure, signed jointly by the pumping engineer and the concrete supplier.","failure":"注意干擾：只以靜壓估算泵壓、低估高強度混凝土的摩擦，樓層升高後泵壓不足，混凝土在管中停滯並堵管；泵壓接近設備上限時，管線接頭與 S 閥磨耗加速，爆管風險升高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Estimating pump pressure from static head alone and underrating friction of high-strength concrete leaves the pump short of pressure as the tower rises, so concrete stalls and blocks the line; running near the equipment limit accelerates wear of couplings and the S-valve and raises the risk of a pipe burst. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以泵送計畫書列出最高澆置點的高度、總管長、彎管數與假設摩擦梯度，計算所需泵壓並保留裕度；施工中以泵機壓力紀錄與管線上的壓力感測器比對預測值，並隨樓層升高逐段更新。","textEn":"List the highest placement level, total line length, number of bends and assumed friction gradient in the pumping plan, compute the required pressure with a margin, and during construction compare pump pressure logs and in-line pressure sensors with predictions, updating them as the building rises.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"泵送計畫要在每一個關鍵高程（例如每 100 m）重新計算泵壓與裕度，並明訂超過某壓力即需改配比、換管或設接力泵的決策點，由泵送工程師與混凝土供應商共同簽認。","textEn":"Recalculate pressure and margin at each key level, for example every 100 m, and set decision points at which a mix change, new pipes or a relay pump is triggered above a given pressure, signed jointly by the pumping engineer and the concrete supplier.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「高程泵送的壓力組成」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Components of high-rise pumping pressure\"?","options":["以泵送計畫書列出最高澆置點的高度、總管長、彎管數與假設摩擦梯度，計算所需泵壓並保留裕度。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["List the highest placement level, total line length, number of bends and assumed friction gradient in the pumping plan, compute the required pressure with a margin, and during construction compare pump pressure logs and in-line pressure sensors with predictions, updating them as the building rises.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以泵送計畫書列出最高澆置點的高度、總管長、彎管數與假設摩擦梯度，計算所需泵壓並保留裕度；施工中以泵機壓力紀錄與管線上的壓力感測器比對預測值，並隨樓層升高逐段更新。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"List the highest placement level, total line length, number of bends and assumed friction gradient in the pumping plan, compute the required pressure with a margin, and during construction compare pump pressure logs and in-line pressure sensors with predictions, updating them as the building rises. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b069-v13-04","title":"高程泵送的壓力組成：失效診斷","titleEn":"Components of high-rise pumping pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「泵送壓力需求」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pump pressure demand” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只以靜壓估算泵壓、低估高強度混凝土的摩擦，樓層升高後泵壓不足，混凝土在管中停滯並堵管；泵壓接近設備上限時，管線接頭與 S 閥磨耗加速，爆管風險升高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Estimating pump pressure from static head alone and underrating friction of high-strength concrete leaves the pump short of pressure as the tower rises, so concrete stalls and blocks the line; running near the equipment limit accelerates wear of couplings and the S-valve and raises the risk of a pipe burst. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：三者相加決定泵機等級、輸送管壁厚與接頭型式，也決定是否需要在中途設接力泵。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Their sum sets the pump class, pipe wall thickness and coupling type, and decides whether an intermediate relay pump is needed.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只以靜壓估算泵壓、低估高強度混凝土的摩擦，樓層升高後泵壓不足，混凝土在管中停滯並堵管；泵壓接近設備上限時，管線接頭與 S 閥磨耗加速，爆管風險升高。","textEn":"Estimating pump pressure from static head alone and underrating friction of high-strength concrete leaves the pump short of pressure as the tower rises, so concrete stalls and blocks the line; running near the equipment limit accelerates wear of couplings and the S-valve and raises the risk of a pipe burst.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「高程泵送的壓力組成」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Components of high-rise pumping pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只以靜壓估算泵壓、低估高強度混凝土的摩擦，樓層升高後泵壓不足，混凝土在管中停滯並堵管；泵壓接近設備上限時，管線接頭與 S 閥磨耗加速，爆管風險升高。","坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Estimating pump pressure from static head alone and underrating friction of high-strength concrete leaves the pump short of pressure as the tower rises, so concrete stalls and blocks the line.","The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只以靜壓估算泵壓、低估高強度混凝土的摩擦，樓層升高後泵壓不足，混凝土在管中停滯並堵管；泵壓接近設備上限時，管線接頭與 S 閥磨耗加速，爆管風險升高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Estimating pump pressure from static head alone and underrating friction of high-strength concrete leaves the pump short of pressure as the tower rises, so concrete stalls and blocks the line; running near the equipment limit accelerates wear of couplings and the S-valve and raises the risk of a pipe burst. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b069-v13-05","title":"潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「管壁潤滑層」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pipe-wall lubrication layer” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"混凝土在管中並不是像水一樣整體流動，而是以塞流方式前進：中間的混凝土幾乎不剪切，只靠管壁附近一層薄薄的漿體或砂漿潤滑層滑動。ACI 304.2R 指出這層邊界潤滑層只有在泵送連續、配比穩定且供料不斷時才能維持。高強度混凝土的漿體黏度高，潤滑層的剪應力也較高，因此同樣流速下摩擦更大；配比中加入適量的細粉料、黏度調整劑或選擇合適的減水劑，可以在不降低強度的情況下改善可泵性。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「管壁潤滑層」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Concrete does not flow through a pipe like water; it advances as a plug: the core barely shears and slides on a thin layer of paste or mortar at the wall. ACI 304.2R notes that this boundary lubrication layer survives only while pumping is continuous, the mix is consistent and supply is uninterrupted. High-strength concrete has a viscous paste, so the shear stress in the layer is higher and friction at a given velocity is greater; suitable fines, viscosity-modifying admixtures or a well-chosen superplasticiser can improve pumpability without reducing strength. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pipe-wall lubrication layer” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：管壁剪應力 τ = τ₀ + η_i·v，摩擦梯度 i = 2τ/R。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Wall shear stress τ = τ₀ + η_i·v and friction gradient i = 2τ/R.","failure":"常見誤解：「坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「管壁潤滑層」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pipe-wall lubrication layer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-05-k1","title":"潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變","titleEn":"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete","text":"混凝土在管中並不是像水一樣整體流動，而是以塞流方式前進：中間的混凝土幾乎不剪切，只靠管壁附近一層薄薄的漿體或砂漿潤滑層滑動。ACI 304.2R 指出這層邊界潤滑層只有在泵送連續、配比穩定且供料不斷時才能維持。","textEn":"Concrete does not flow through a pipe like water; it advances as a plug: the core barely shears and slides on a thin layer of paste or mortar at the wall. ACI 304.2R notes that this boundary lubrication layer survives only while pumping is continuous, the mix is consistent and supply is uninterrupted.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete\" is correct?","options":["坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。","輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。","混凝土在管中並不是像水一樣整體流動，而是以塞流方式前進：中間的混凝土幾乎不剪切，只靠管壁附近一層薄薄的漿體或砂漿潤滑層滑動。"],"optionsEn":["The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump.","A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.","Concrete does not flow through a pipe like water; it advances as a plug: the core barely shears and slides on a thin layer of paste or mortar at the wall."],"answer":2,"explanation":"混凝土在管中並不是像水一樣整體流動，而是以塞流方式前進：中間的混凝土幾乎不剪切，只靠管壁附近一層薄薄的漿體或砂漿潤滑層滑動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Concrete does not flow through a pipe like water; it advances as a plug: the core barely shears and slides on a thin layer of paste or mortar at the wall. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b069-v13-06","title":"潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變：定量估算","titleEn":"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「管壁潤滑層」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pipe-wall lubrication layer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：管壁剪應力 τ = τ₀ + η_i·v，摩擦梯度 i = 2τ/R。管半徑 R = 0.0625 m、v = 1.0 m/s：一般高強配比 τ₀ = 30 Pa、η_i = 300 Pa·s/m，τ = 330 Pa，i ≈ 0.0106 MPa/m；黏度加倍 η_i = 600 時 τ = 630 Pa，i ≈ 0.0202 MPa/m，700 m 管線的總泵壓由約 22.8 MPa 升到約 29.5 MPa。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Wall shear stress τ = τ₀ + η_i·v and friction gradient i = 2τ/R. With R = 0.0625 m and v = 1.0 m/s, a typical high-strength mix with τ₀ = 30 Pa and η_i = 300 Pa·s/m gives τ = 330 Pa and i ≈ 0.0106 MPa/m; doubling η_i to 600 gives τ = 630 Pa and i ≈ 0.0202 MPa/m, raising total pressure on a 700 m line from about 22.8 MPa to about 29.5 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以管道流變儀或試驗迴路量測不同配比的界面屈服應力與黏度常數，或以兩支相距已知距離的壓力感測器量測實際摩擦梯度；把結果回填泵壓計算，選出在強度、坍流度與摩擦之間平衡的配比。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure interface yield stress and viscous constant for candidate mixes with a tribometer or test loop, or measure actual friction gradient with two pressure sensors a known distance apart; feed the results back into the pressure calculation and choose a mix that balances strength, slump flow and friction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"管壁剪應力 τ = τ₀ + η_i·v，摩擦梯度 i = 2τ/R。管半徑 R = 0.0625 m、v = 1.0 m/s：一般高強配比 τ₀ = 30 Pa、η_i = 300 Pa·s/m，τ = 330 Pa，i ≈ 0.0106 MPa/m；黏度加倍 η_i = 600 時 τ = 630 Pa，i ≈ 0.0202 MPa/m，700 m 管線的總泵壓由約 22.8 MPa 升到約 29.5 MPa。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Wall shear stress τ = τ₀ + η_i·v and friction gradient i = 2τ/R. With R = 0.0625 m and v = 1.0 m/s, a typical high-strength mix with τ₀ = 30 Pa and η_i = 300 Pa·s/m gives τ = 330 Pa and i ≈ 0.0106 MPa/m; doubling η_i to 600 gives τ = 630 Pa and i ≈ 0.0202 MPa/m, raising total pressure on a 700 m line from about 22.8 MPa to about 29.5 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete\", which statement holds?","options":["管壁剪應力 τ = τ₀ + η_i·v，摩擦梯度 i = 2τ/R。","垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。","只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Wall shear stress τ = τ₀ + η_i·v and friction gradient i = 2τ/R.","A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required.","One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall."],"answer":0,"explanation":"管壁剪應力 τ = τ₀ + η_i·v，摩擦梯度 i = 2τ/R。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Wall shear stress τ = τ₀ + η_i·v and friction gradient i = 2τ/R. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b069-v13-07","title":"潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管壁潤滑層」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pipe-wall lubrication layer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以管道流變儀或試驗迴路量測不同配比的界面屈服應力與黏度常數，或以兩支相距已知距離的壓力感測器量測實際摩擦梯度；把結果回填泵壓計算，選出在強度、坍流度與摩擦之間平衡的配比。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure interface yield stress and viscous constant for candidate mixes with a tribometer or test loop, or measure actual friction gradient with two pressure sensors a known distance apart; feed the results back into the pressure calculation and choose a mix that balances strength, slump flow and friction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：配比審查除強度與坍流度外，應要求提出可泵性證據（摩擦梯度或試驗迴路結果）與配比調整範圍；高層段若改用更高強度，必須重新做可泵性評估再放行。","observationEn":"Site practice: Mix review should require pumpability evidence, such as friction gradient or loop results, and an allowed adjustment range in addition to strength and slump flow; any switch to higher strength in upper zones must be re-evaluated for pumpability before release.","failure":"注意干擾：為了提高強度而一味降低用水量，混凝土黏度大增，潤滑層變薄，泵壓急升並出現間歇性堵管；配比中粗骨材級配不良時，漿體被擠出而骨材在彎管處形成架橋，造成難以清除的堵塞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Cutting water to chase strength sharply raises viscosity, thins the lubrication layer and makes pump pressure spike with intermittent blockages; a poorly graded coarse aggregate lets paste be squeezed out so aggregate bridges at bends and forms blockages that are hard to clear. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以管道流變儀或試驗迴路量測不同配比的界面屈服應力與黏度常數，或以兩支相距已知距離的壓力感測器量測實際摩擦梯度；把結果回填泵壓計算，選出在強度、坍流度與摩擦之間平衡的配比。","textEn":"Measure interface yield stress and viscous constant for candidate mixes with a tribometer or test loop, or measure actual friction gradient with two pressure sensors a known distance apart; feed the results back into the pressure calculation and choose a mix that balances strength, slump flow and friction.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"配比審查除強度與坍流度外，應要求提出可泵性證據（摩擦梯度或試驗迴路結果）與配比調整範圍；高層段若改用更高強度，必須重新做可泵性評估再放行。","textEn":"Mix review should require pumpability evidence, such as friction gradient or loop results, and an allowed adjustment range in addition to strength and slump flow; any switch to higher strength in upper zones must be re-evaluated for pumpability before release.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以管道流變儀或試驗迴路量測不同配比的界面屈服應力與黏度常數，或以兩支相距已知距離的壓力感測器量測實際摩擦梯度。","管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Measure interface yield stress and viscous constant for candidate mixes with a tribometer or test loop, or measure actual friction gradient with two pressure sensors a known distance apart.","If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以管道流變儀或試驗迴路量測不同配比的界面屈服應力與黏度常數，或以兩支相距已知距離的壓力感測器量測實際摩擦梯度；把結果回填泵壓計算，選出在強度、坍流度與摩擦之間平衡的配比。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure interface yield stress and viscous constant for candidate mixes with a tribometer or test loop, or measure actual friction gradient with two pressure sensors a known distance apart; feed the results back into the pressure calculation and choose a mix that balances strength, slump flow and friction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b069-v13-08","title":"潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變：失效診斷","titleEn":"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「管壁潤滑層」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pipe-wall lubrication layer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"為了提高強度而一味降低用水量，混凝土黏度大增，潤滑層變薄，泵壓急升並出現間歇性堵管；配比中粗骨材級配不良時，漿體被擠出而骨材在彎管處形成架橋，造成難以清除的堵塞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Cutting water to chase strength sharply raises viscosity, thins the lubrication layer and makes pump pressure spike with intermittent blockages; a poorly graded coarse aggregate lets paste be squeezed out so aggregate bridges at bends and forms blockages that are hard to clear. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：高強度混凝土的漿體黏度高，潤滑層的剪應力也較高，因此同樣流速下摩擦更大；配比中加入適量的細粉料、黏度調整劑或選擇合適的減水劑，可以在不降低強度的情況下改善可泵性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: High-strength concrete has a viscous paste, so the shear stress in the layer is higher and friction at a given velocity is greater; suitable fines, viscosity-modifying admixtures or a well-chosen superplasticiser can improve pumpability without reducing strength.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了提高強度而一味降低用水量，混凝土黏度大增，潤滑層變薄，泵壓急升並出現間歇性堵管；配比中粗骨材級配不良時，漿體被擠出而骨材在彎管處形成架橋，造成難以清除的堵塞。","textEn":"Cutting water to chase strength sharply raises viscosity, thins the lubrication layer and makes pump pressure spike with intermittent blockages; a poorly graded coarse aggregate lets paste be squeezed out so aggregate bridges at bends and forms blockages that are hard to clear.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「潤滑層與高強度混凝土的流變」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"The lubrication layer and the rheology of high-strength concrete\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。","為了提高強度而一味降低用水量，混凝土黏度大增，潤滑層變薄，泵壓急升並出現間歇性堵管。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.","Cutting water to chase strength sharply raises viscosity, thins the lubrication layer and makes pump pressure spike with intermittent blockages."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了提高強度而一味降低用水量，混凝土黏度大增，潤滑層變薄，泵壓急升並出現間歇性堵管；配比中粗骨材級配不良時，漿體被擠出而骨材在彎管處形成架橋，造成難以清除的堵塞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Cutting water to chase strength sharply raises viscosity, thins the lubrication layer and makes pump pressure spike with intermittent blockages; a poorly graded coarse aggregate lets paste be squeezed out so aggregate bridges at bends and forms blockages that are hard to clear. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b069-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度」與「泵機輸出、壓力與功率」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance\" and \"Pump output, pressure and power\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b069-v13-09","title":"管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「高壓輸送管與接頭」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “High-pressure pipes and couplings” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超高層泵送管必須承受 20 MPa 以上的內壓，並在數萬立方公尺混凝土的磨耗下保持強度。常用的是經硬化處理的雙層或厚壁鋼管，以高壓法蘭或螺栓式接頭連接，接頭需同時防漏漿與承受拉脫力。管壁厚度由內壓與容許應力決定，再加上磨耗裕度；彎管外側磨耗最快，常做成加厚或可旋轉的耐磨彎頭。ACI 304.2R 提到早期活塞泵通常配用 150 mm 以上管徑，超高層則常用較小管徑以降低管內混凝土重量與接頭負擔。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「高壓輸送管與接頭」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Supertall pump lines must resist internal pressures above 20 MPa and keep their strength while tens of thousands of cubic metres of concrete wear them away. Hardened double-wall or thick-wall steel pipes are common, joined by high-pressure flanged or bolted couplings that must both seal against grout loss and resist pull-apart forces. Wall thickness is set by internal pressure and allowable stress plus a wear allowance; the outside of bends wears fastest and is often thickened or made as rotatable wear elbows. ACI 304.2R notes that early piston pumps typically used lines of 150 mm or more, whereas supertall lines often use smaller bores to reduce the weight of concrete in the line and the load on couplings. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “High-pressure pipes and couplings” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Barlow 公式 t = pD/(2σ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Barlow's formula t = pD/(2σ).","failure":"常見誤解：「輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「高壓輸送管與接頭」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “High-pressure pipes and couplings”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-09-k1","title":"管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度","titleEn":"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance","text":"超高層泵送管必須承受 20 MPa 以上的內壓，並在數萬立方公尺混凝土的磨耗下保持強度。常用的是經硬化處理的雙層或厚壁鋼管，以高壓法蘭或螺栓式接頭連接，接頭需同時防漏漿與承受拉脫力。","textEn":"Supertall pump lines must resist internal pressures above 20 MPa and keep their strength while tens of thousands of cubic metres of concrete wear them away. Hardened double-wall or thick-wall steel pipes are common, joined by high-pressure flanged or bolted couplings that must both seal against grout loss and resist pull-apart forces.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance\" is correct?","options":["超高層泵送管必須承受 20 MPa 以上的內壓，並在數萬立方公尺混凝土的磨耗下保持強度。","輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。","泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。"],"optionsEn":["Supertall pump lines must resist internal pressures above 20 MPa and keep their strength while tens of thousands of cubic metres of concrete wear them away.","A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.","A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"超高層泵送管必須承受 20 MPa 以上的內壓，並在數萬立方公尺混凝土的磨耗下保持強度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Supertall pump lines must resist internal pressures above 20 MPa and keep their strength while tens of thousands of cubic metres of concrete wear them away. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b069-v13-10","title":"管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度：定量估算","titleEn":"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高壓輸送管與接頭」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “High-pressure pipes and couplings” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Barlow 公式 t = pD/(2σ)。p = 22.4 MPa、D = 150 mm、容許應力 300 MPa 時 t = 22.4×150/600 = 5.6 mm；加上 4.4 mm 磨耗裕度，新管壁厚取 10 mm。若泵壓升到 29.5 MPa，所需厚度增為約 7.4 mm，磨耗裕度只剩 2.6 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Barlow's formula t = pD/(2σ). With p = 22.4 MPa, D = 150 mm and 300 MPa allowable stress, t = 22.4×150/600 = 5.6 mm; adding a 4.4 mm wear allowance gives a 10 mm new wall. If pressure rises to 29.5 MPa, the required thickness grows to about 7.4 mm and only 2.6 mm of wear allowance remains. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：輸送管與接頭須有製造商的耐壓等級證明與材料硬度報告；安裝前逐根以超音波測厚記錄基準厚度並編號，接頭螺栓依規定扭力鎖緊並做標記，第一次加壓時巡查漏漿與滲水。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Pipes and couplings need the manufacturer's pressure rating and hardness reports; before installation record a baseline ultrasonic thickness for each numbered pipe, tighten coupling bolts to the specified torque and mark them, and walk the line for grout or water leaks at first pressurisation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Barlow 公式 t = pD/(2σ)。p = 22.4 MPa、D = 150 mm、容許應力 300 MPa 時 t = 22.4×150/600 = 5.6 mm；加上 4.4 mm 磨耗裕度，新管壁厚取 10 mm。若泵壓升到 29.5 MPa，所需厚度增為約 7.4 mm，磨耗裕度只剩 2.6 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Barlow's formula t = pD/(2σ). With p = 22.4 MPa, D = 150 mm and 300 MPa allowable stress, t = 22.4×150/600 = 5.6 mm; adding a 4.4 mm wear allowance gives a 10 mm new wall. If pressure rises to 29.5 MPa, the required thickness grows to about 7.4 mm and only 2.6 mm of wear allowance remains. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance\", which statement holds?","options":["泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","Barlow 公式 t = pD/(2σ)。","混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","Barlow's formula t = pD/(2σ).","If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Barlow 公式 t = pD/(2σ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Barlow's formula t = pD/(2σ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b069-v13-11","title":"管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「高壓輸送管與接頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “High-pressure pipes and couplings” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"輸送管與接頭須有製造商的耐壓等級證明與材料硬度報告；安裝前逐根以超音波測厚記錄基準厚度並編號，接頭螺栓依規定扭力鎖緊並做標記，第一次加壓時巡查漏漿與滲水。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Pipes and couplings need the manufacturer's pressure rating and hardness reports; before installation record a baseline ultrasonic thickness for each numbered pipe, tighten coupling bolts to the specified torque and mark them, and walk the line for grout or water leaks at first pressurisation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以管段編號與位置圖管理所有高壓管與彎頭，規定不同壓力區只能使用相對應等級的管件；接頭與管段的更換與測厚紀錄須能追溯，高壓區設人員禁入區與防護罩。","observationEn":"Site practice: Manage every high-pressure pipe and elbow by number and location drawing, allow only matching pressure grades in each pressure zone, keep traceable replacement and thickness records, and set exclusion zones and guards around high-pressure sections.","failure":"注意干擾：混用不同等級的管段或以一般接頭代替高壓接頭，在高壓段爆裂或拉脫，高速噴出的混凝土與管段碎片可傷及人員；彎管外側磨薄而未更換，在最高壓力時破裂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Mixing pipe grades or substituting ordinary couplings for high-pressure ones lets the line burst or pull apart in the high-pressure zone, and concrete and fragments ejected at speed can injure people; bends worn thin on the outside and not replaced rupture at peak pressure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"輸送管與接頭須有製造商的耐壓等級證明與材料硬度報告；安裝前逐根以超音波測厚記錄基準厚度並編號，接頭螺栓依規定扭力鎖緊並做標記，第一次加壓時巡查漏漿與滲水。","textEn":"Pipes and couplings need the manufacturer's pressure rating and hardness reports; before installation record a baseline ultrasonic thickness for each numbered pipe, tighten coupling bolts to the specified torque and mark them, and walk the line for grout or water leaks at first pressurisation.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以管段編號與位置圖管理所有高壓管與彎頭，規定不同壓力區只能使用相對應等級的管件；接頭與管段的更換與測厚紀錄須能追溯，高壓區設人員禁入區與防護罩。","textEn":"Manage every high-pressure pipe and elbow by number and location drawing, allow only matching pressure grades in each pressure zone, keep traceable replacement and thickness records, and set exclusion zones and guards around high-pressure sections.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。","輸送管與接頭須有製造商的耐壓等級證明與材料硬度報告；安裝前逐根以超音波測厚記錄基準厚度並編號，接頭螺栓依規定扭力鎖緊並做標記，第一次加壓時巡查漏漿與滲水。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed.","Pipes and couplings need the manufacturer's pressure rating and hardness reports."],"answer":2,"explanation":"輸送管與接頭須有製造商的耐壓等級證明與材料硬度報告；安裝前逐根以超音波測厚記錄基準厚度並編號，接頭螺栓依規定扭力鎖緊並做標記，第一次加壓時巡查漏漿與滲水。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Pipes and couplings need the manufacturer's pressure rating and hardness reports; before installation record a baseline ultrasonic thickness for each numbered pipe, tighten coupling bolts to the specified torque and mark them, and walk the line for grout or water leaks at first pressurisation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b069-v13-12","title":"管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高壓輸送管與接頭」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “High-pressure pipes and couplings” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"混用不同等級的管段或以一般接頭代替高壓接頭，在高壓段爆裂或拉脫，高速噴出的混凝土與管段碎片可傷及人員；彎管外側磨薄而未更換，在最高壓力時破裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Mixing pipe grades or substituting ordinary couplings for high-pressure ones lets the line burst or pull apart in the high-pressure zone, and concrete and fragments ejected at speed can injure people; bends worn thin on the outside and not replaced rupture at peak pressure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：ACI 304.2R 提到早期活塞泵通常配用 150 mm 以上管徑，超高層則常用較小管徑以降低管內混凝土重量與接頭負擔。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: ACI 304.2R notes that early piston pumps typically used lines of 150 mm or more, whereas supertall lines often use smaller bores to reduce the weight of concrete in the line and the load on couplings.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"混用不同等級的管段或以一般接頭代替高壓接頭，在高壓段爆裂或拉脫，高速噴出的混凝土與管段碎片可傷及人員；彎管外側磨薄而未更換，在最高壓力時破裂。","textEn":"Mixing pipe grades or substituting ordinary couplings for high-pressure ones lets the line burst or pull apart in the high-pressure zone, and concrete and fragments ejected at speed can injure people; bends worn thin on the outside and not replaced rupture at peak pressure.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「管壁厚度、接頭與磨耗裕度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pipe wall thickness, couplings and wear allowance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["混用不同等級的管段或以一般接頭代替高壓接頭，在高壓段爆裂或拉脫，高速噴出的混凝土與管段碎片可傷及人員；彎管外側磨薄而未更換，在最高壓力時破裂。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。"],"optionsEn":["Mixing pipe grades or substituting ordinary couplings for high-pressure ones lets the line burst or pull apart in the high-pressure zone, and concrete and fragments ejected at speed can injure people.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"混用不同等級的管段或以一般接頭代替高壓接頭，在高壓段爆裂或拉脫，高速噴出的混凝土與管段碎片可傷及人員；彎管外側磨薄而未更換，在最高壓力時破裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mixing pipe grades or substituting ordinary couplings for high-pressure ones lets the line burst or pull apart in the high-pressure zone, and concrete and fragments ejected at speed can injure people; bends worn thin on the outside and not replaced rupture at peak pressure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b069-v13-13","title":"泵機輸出、壓力與功率：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pump output, pressure and power: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「泵機與 S 閥」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pump unit and S-valve” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超高壓拖式泵以兩支混凝土缸交替推送，S 閥在兩缸之間切換，把混凝土送入輸送管。泵機能提供的混凝土壓力取決於油壓與主油缸對混凝土缸的面積比，提高混凝土壓力就必須降低排量，因此同一台泵在高壓時輸出較小。哈里發塔的泵送站以兩台 Putzmeister BSA 14000 SHP-D 與一台 BSA 14000 HP-D 組成，泵機的機架、料斗與 S 閥都為預期壓力加強；上海中心大廈則以三一重工 HBT90CH 系列超高壓拖泵泵送核心筒混凝土。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「泵機與 S 閥」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An ultra-high-pressure trailer pump drives two concrete cylinders alternately, with an S-valve switching between them to feed the line. The concrete pressure a pump can deliver depends on hydraulic pressure and the area ratio between the drive cylinders and concrete cylinders, so higher concrete pressure means lower output, and the same pump delivers less at high pressure. Burj Khalifa's pumping station combined two Putzmeister BSA 14000 SHP-D units and one BSA 14000 HP-D, with frames, hoppers and S-valves reinforced for the expected pressures; Shanghai Tower used Sany HBT90CH-series ultra-high-pressure trailer pumps for its core concrete. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pump unit and S-valve” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：水力功率 P = p·Q。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Hydraulic power P = p·Q.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「泵機與 S 閥」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pump unit and S-valve”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-13-k1","title":"泵機輸出、壓力與功率","titleEn":"Pump output, pressure and power","text":"超高壓拖式泵以兩支混凝土缸交替推送，S 閥在兩缸之間切換，把混凝土送入輸送管。泵機能提供的混凝土壓力取決於油壓與主油缸對混凝土缸的面積比，提高混凝土壓力就必須降低排量，因此同一台泵在高壓時輸出較小。","textEn":"An ultra-high-pressure trailer pump drives two concrete cylinders alternately, with an S-valve switching between them to feed the line. The concrete pressure a pump can deliver depends on hydraulic pressure and the area ratio between the drive cylinders and concrete cylinders, so higher concrete pressure means lower output, and the same pump delivers less at high pressure.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「泵機輸出、壓力與功率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pump output, pressure and power\" is correct?","options":["泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。","超高壓拖式泵以兩支混凝土缸交替推送，S 閥在兩缸之間切換，把混凝土送入輸送管。","垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。"],"optionsEn":["A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time.","An ultra-high-pressure trailer pump drives two concrete cylinders alternately, with an S-valve switching between them to feed the line.","A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required."],"answer":1,"explanation":"超高壓拖式泵以兩支混凝土缸交替推送，S 閥在兩缸之間切換，把混凝土送入輸送管。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An ultra-high-pressure trailer pump drives two concrete cylinders alternately, with an S-valve switching between them to feed the line. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b069-v13-14","title":"泵機輸出、壓力與功率：定量估算","titleEn":"Pump output, pressure and power: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「泵機與 S 閥」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pump unit and S-valve” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：水力功率 P = p·Q。排量 Q = 40 m³/h = 0.0111 m³/s、泵壓 22.4 MPa 時 P ≈ 249 kW，效率 0.75 時引擎約需 332 kW。管徑 125 mm 時截面 A ≈ 0.0123 m²，流速 v = Q/A ≈ 0.91 m/s，與前述 1.0 m/s 的摩擦假設一致。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Hydraulic power P = p·Q. At Q = 40 m³/h = 0.0111 m³/s and 22.4 MPa, P ≈ 249 kW, about 332 kW of engine power at 0.75 efficiency. In a 125 mm line the area is A ≈ 0.0123 m², so velocity v = Q/A ≈ 0.91 m/s, consistent with the 1.0 m/s friction assumption. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對泵機性能曲線，確認所需壓力與排量組合落在曲線內並有裕度；現場記錄每次泵送的出口壓力、行程頻率與排量，並安排備用泵機與關鍵零件（S 閥、眼鏡板、切割環），以免單機故障中斷澆置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check the pump's performance curve to confirm that the required pressure and output lie inside it with a margin; log outlet pressure, stroke rate and output for every pour, and keep a standby pump and critical spares such as S-valves, wear plates and cutting rings so that a single failure does not interrupt a pour.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"水力功率 P = p·Q。排量 Q = 40 m³/h = 0.0111 m³/s、泵壓 22.4 MPa 時 P ≈ 249 kW，效率 0.75 時引擎約需 332 kW。管徑 125 mm 時截面 A ≈ 0.0123 m²，流速 v = Q/A ≈ 0.91 m/s，與前述 1.0 m/s 的摩擦假設一致。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Hydraulic power P = p·Q. At Q = 40 m³/h = 0.0111 m³/s and 22.4 MPa, P ≈ 249 kW, about 332 kW of engine power at 0.75 efficiency. In a 125 mm line the area is A ≈ 0.0123 m², so velocity v = Q/A ≈ 0.91 m/s, consistent with the 1.0 m/s friction assumption. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「泵機輸出、壓力與功率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pump output, pressure and power\", which statement holds?","options":["只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。","管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。","水力功率 P = p·Q。"],"optionsEn":["One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall.","If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.","Hydraulic power P = p·Q."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水力功率 P = p·Q。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Hydraulic power P = p·Q. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b069-v13-15","title":"泵機輸出、壓力與功率：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pump output, pressure and power: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「泵機與 S 閥」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pump unit and S-valve” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對泵機性能曲線，確認所需壓力與排量組合落在曲線內並有裕度；現場記錄每次泵送的出口壓力、行程頻率與排量，並安排備用泵機與關鍵零件（S 閥、眼鏡板、切割環），以免單機故障中斷澆置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check the pump's performance curve to confirm that the required pressure and output lie inside it with a margin; log outlet pressure, stroke rate and output for every pour, and keep a standby pump and critical spares such as S-valves, wear plates and cutting rings so that a single failure does not interrupt a pour. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：重要澆置（例如巨柱或核心筒的關鍵段）前，泵機須完成保養並備妥備用機，泵送計畫書附上壓力—排量工作點；泵機操作員與樓上布料人員要有直接通訊，並規定停泵與降壓的指令方式。","observationEn":"Site practice: Before critical pours such as key megacolumn or core lifts, service the pump and have a standby ready, attach the pressure–output operating point to the pumping plan, give the pump operator and the placing crew upstairs direct communication, and define how stop and pressure-relief orders are given.","failure":"注意干擾：泵機長時間在最高壓力下運轉，眼鏡板與切割環磨耗加快，漏漿使有效壓力下降，最終在關鍵澆置途中停機，形成冷縫；只依額定最大排量排程，忽略高壓時排量下降，供料計畫失準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Running a pump at maximum pressure for long periods accelerates wear of the wear plate and cutting ring, leakage cuts effective pressure and the pump finally stops mid-pour, creating a cold joint; scheduling on the rated maximum output while ignoring the drop at high pressure throws the supply plan off. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對泵機性能曲線，確認所需壓力與排量組合落在曲線內並有裕度；現場記錄每次泵送的出口壓力、行程頻率與排量，並安排備用泵機與關鍵零件（S 閥、眼鏡板、切割環），以免單機故障中斷澆置。","textEn":"Check the pump's performance curve to confirm that the required pressure and output lie inside it with a margin; log outlet pressure, stroke rate and output for every pour, and keep a standby pump and critical spares such as S-valves, wear plates and cutting rings so that a single failure does not interrupt a pour.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"重要澆置（例如巨柱或核心筒的關鍵段）前，泵機須完成保養並備妥備用機，泵送計畫書附上壓力—排量工作點；泵機操作員與樓上布料人員要有直接通訊，並規定停泵與降壓的指令方式。","textEn":"Before critical pours such as key megacolumn or core lifts, service the pump and have a standby ready, attach the pressure–output operating point to the pumping plan, give the pump operator and the placing crew upstairs direct communication, and define how stop and pressure-relief orders are given.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「泵機輸出、壓力與功率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pump output, pressure and power\"?","options":["核對泵機性能曲線，確認所需壓力與排量組合落在曲線內並有裕度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。"],"optionsEn":["Check the pump's performance curve to confirm that the required pressure and output lie inside it with a margin.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對泵機性能曲線，確認所需壓力與排量組合落在曲線內並有裕度；現場記錄每次泵送的出口壓力、行程頻率與排量，並安排備用泵機與關鍵零件（S 閥、眼鏡板、切割環），以免單機故障中斷澆置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check the pump's performance curve to confirm that the required pressure and output lie inside it with a margin; log outlet pressure, stroke rate and output for every pour, and keep a standby pump and critical spares such as S-valves, wear plates and cutting rings so that a single failure does not interrupt a pour. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b069-v13-16","title":"泵機輸出、壓力與功率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pump output, pressure and power: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「泵機與 S 閥」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pump unit and S-valve” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"泵機長時間在最高壓力下運轉，眼鏡板與切割環磨耗加快，漏漿使有效壓力下降，最終在關鍵澆置途中停機，形成冷縫；只依額定最大排量排程，忽略高壓時排量下降，供料計畫失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Running a pump at maximum pressure for long periods accelerates wear of the wear plate and cutting ring, leakage cuts effective pressure and the pump finally stops mid-pour, creating a cold joint; scheduling on the rated maximum output while ignoring the drop at high pressure throws the supply plan off. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：哈里發塔的泵送站以兩台 Putzmeister BSA 14000 SHP-D 與一台 BSA 14000 HP-D 組成，泵機的機架、料斗與 S 閥都為預期壓力加強；上海中心大廈則以三一重工 HBT90CH 系列超高壓拖泵泵送核心筒混凝土。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Burj Khalifa's pumping station combined two Putzmeister BSA 14000 SHP-D units and one BSA 14000 HP-D, with frames, hoppers and S-valves reinforced for the expected pressures; Shanghai Tower used Sany HBT90CH-series ultra-high-pressure trailer pumps for its core concrete.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"泵機長時間在最高壓力下運轉，眼鏡板與切割環磨耗加快，漏漿使有效壓力下降，最終在關鍵澆置途中停機，形成冷縫；只依額定最大排量排程，忽略高壓時排量下降，供料計畫失準。","textEn":"Running a pump at maximum pressure for long periods accelerates wear of the wear plate and cutting ring, leakage cuts effective pressure and the pump finally stops mid-pour, creating a cold joint; scheduling on the rated maximum output while ignoring the drop at high pressure throws the supply plan off.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「泵機輸出、壓力與功率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pump output, pressure and power\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","泵機長時間在最高壓力下運轉，眼鏡板與切割環磨耗加快，漏漿使有效壓力下降，最終在關鍵澆置途中停機，形成冷縫。","垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Running a pump at maximum pressure for long periods accelerates wear of the wear plate and cutting ring, leakage cuts effective pressure and the pump finally stops mid-pour, creating a cold joint.","A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required."],"answer":1,"explanation":"泵機長時間在最高壓力下運轉，眼鏡板與切割環磨耗加快，漏漿使有效壓力下降，最終在關鍵澆置途中停機，形成冷縫；只依額定最大排量排程，忽略高壓時排量下降，供料計畫失準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Running a pump at maximum pressure for long periods accelerates wear of the wear plate and cutting ring, leakage cuts effective pressure and the pump finally stops mid-pour, creating a cold joint; scheduling on the rated maximum output while ignoring the drop at high pressure throws the supply plan off. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b069-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「管線佈置、固定與止回」與「開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Line layout, fixing and shut-off\" and \"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b069-v13-17","title":"管線佈置、固定與止回：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Line layout, fixing and shut-off: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「管線佈置與固定」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Line layout and fixing” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"垂直泵送管沿核心筒內的豎井或牆面設置，每層以管夾固定在結構上，承受管線與管內混凝土的重量以及每一次泵送衝程的脈動。彎管處的內壓會產生很大的推力，底部的水平轉垂直彎頭尤其關鍵，必須以混凝土座或鋼支架錨固。泵機出口與垂直段之間通常保留一段水平管，並在垂直段底部設置截止閥，停泵或更換管件時防止數百公尺混凝土柱回流衝擊泵機。管線也必須避開會隨樓層升高而移動的爬模平台。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「管線佈置與固定」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The vertical line runs up a shaft or along walls of the core, clamped to the structure at every floor to carry the weight of pipe and concrete and the pulsation of each pump stroke. Internal pressure at bends produces large thrust, and the bottom horizontal-to-vertical elbow is especially critical, anchored in a concrete block or steel frame. A horizontal run is usually kept between the pump outlet and the vertical section, with a shut-off valve at the foot of the riser so that, when pumping stops or pipes are changed, hundreds of metres of concrete cannot flow back and hit the pump. The line must also clear climbing-form platforms that move up with the building. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Line layout and fixing” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：彎管推力 F = p·A。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Bend thrust F = p·A.","failure":"常見誤解：「垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「管線佈置與固定」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Line layout and fixing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-17-k1","title":"管線佈置、固定與止回","titleEn":"Line layout, fixing and shut-off","text":"垂直泵送管沿核心筒內的豎井或牆面設置，每層以管夾固定在結構上，承受管線與管內混凝土的重量以及每一次泵送衝程的脈動。彎管處的內壓會產生很大的推力，底部的水平轉垂直彎頭尤其關鍵，必須以混凝土座或鋼支架錨固。","textEn":"The vertical line runs up a shaft or along walls of the core, clamped to the structure at every floor to carry the weight of pipe and concrete and the pulsation of each pump stroke. Internal pressure at bends produces large thrust, and the bottom horizontal-to-vertical elbow is especially critical, anchored in a concrete block or steel frame.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「管線佈置、固定與止回」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Line layout, fixing and shut-off\" is correct?","options":["垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。","泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","垂直泵送管沿核心筒內的豎井或牆面設置，每層以管夾固定在結構上，承受管線與管內混凝土的重量以及每一次泵送衝程的脈動。"],"optionsEn":["A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required.","Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","The vertical line runs up a shaft or along walls of the core, clamped to the structure at every floor to carry the weight of pipe and concrete and the pulsation of each pump stroke."],"answer":2,"explanation":"垂直泵送管沿核心筒內的豎井或牆面設置，每層以管夾固定在結構上，承受管線與管內混凝土的重量以及每一次泵送衝程的脈動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The vertical line runs up a shaft or along walls of the core, clamped to the structure at every floor to carry the weight of pipe and concrete and the pulsation of each pump stroke. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b069-v13-18","title":"管線佈置、固定與止回：定量估算","titleEn":"Line layout, fixing and shut-off: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「管線佈置與固定」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Line layout and fixing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：彎管推力 F = p·A。p = 22.4 MPa、A ≈ 0.0123 m² 時單向推力約 275 kN，90° 彎管合力約 √2×275 ≈ 389 kN。每 4 m 樓層的管線重：鋼管約 34.5 kg/m 加混凝土約 30.1 kg/m，共約 64.6 kg/m，每層管夾約承受 2.5 kN 的靜重，另加泵送脈動。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Bend thrust F = p·A. At p = 22.4 MPa and A ≈ 0.0123 m² the thrust is about 275 kN in each direction and the resultant at a 90° bend about √2×275 ≈ 389 kN. Per 4 m storey the line weighs about 34.5 kg/m of steel plus about 30.1 kg/m of concrete, about 64.6 kg/m, so each floor clamp carries about 2.5 kN of static weight plus pumping pulsation. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：管線佈置圖須標示每一個彎管位置、錨座設計反力、管夾間距與截止閥位置，由結構工程師確認錨座與預埋件能承受推力；首次高壓泵送時觀察底部錨座與管夾是否移位，並量測管線振動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: The line layout drawing should show every bend, anchor design reactions, clamp spacing and shut-off valve location, with the structural engineer confirming that anchors and embeds can take the thrust; at the first high-pressure pour watch the bottom anchor and clamps for movement and measure line vibration.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"彎管推力 F = p·A。p = 22.4 MPa、A ≈ 0.0123 m² 時單向推力約 275 kN，90° 彎管合力約 √2×275 ≈ 389 kN。每 4 m 樓層的管線重：鋼管約 34.5 kg/m 加混凝土約 30.1 kg/m，共約 64.6 kg/m，每層管夾約承受 2.5 kN 的靜重，另加泵送脈動。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Bend thrust F = p·A. At p = 22.4 MPa and A ≈ 0.0123 m² the thrust is about 275 kN in each direction and the resultant at a 90° bend about √2×275 ≈ 389 kN. Per 4 m storey the line weighs about 34.5 kg/m of steel plus about 30.1 kg/m of concrete, about 64.6 kg/m, so each floor clamp carries about 2.5 kN of static weight plus pumping pulsation. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「管線佈置、固定與止回」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Line layout, fixing and shut-off\", which statement holds?","options":["彎管推力 F = p·A。","混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。","只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。"],"optionsEn":["Bend thrust F = p·A.","If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top.","If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"彎管推力 F = p·A。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Bend thrust F = p·A. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b069-v13-19","title":"管線佈置、固定與止回：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Line layout, fixing and shut-off: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管線佈置與固定」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Line layout and fixing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"管線佈置圖須標示每一個彎管位置、錨座設計反力、管夾間距與截止閥位置，由結構工程師確認錨座與預埋件能承受推力；首次高壓泵送時觀察底部錨座與管夾是否移位，並量測管線振動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"The line layout drawing should show every bend, anchor design reactions, clamp spacing and shut-off valve location, with the structural engineer confirming that anchors and embeds can take the thrust; at the first high-pressure pour watch the bottom anchor and clamps for movement and measure line vibration. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：管線錨座、管夾預埋件與通過樓板的開口應在結構施工圖中預先設計，而非現場臨時鑽孔；截止閥、洩壓與清管作業須有書面程序，並列為每次高壓泵送前的檢查項目。","observationEn":"Site practice: Design line anchors, clamp embeds and slab openings into the structural shop drawings rather than drilling them ad hoc; give shut-off, pressure relief and line clearing written procedures and include them in the checklist before every high-pressure pour.","failure":"注意干擾：底部彎頭錨座不足，泵送脈動使彎頭逐漸移位，接頭被拉開而爆管；垂直段底部沒有截止閥，停泵時混凝土柱回流，S 閥與活塞受衝擊損壞，甚至造成人員傷害。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An inadequate anchor at the bottom elbow lets pumping pulses move it bit by bit until a coupling pulls apart and bursts; without a shut-off valve at the riser foot, the concrete column flows back when pumping stops, damaging the S-valve and pistons and possibly injuring people. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"管線佈置圖須標示每一個彎管位置、錨座設計反力、管夾間距與截止閥位置，由結構工程師確認錨座與預埋件能承受推力；首次高壓泵送時觀察底部錨座與管夾是否移位，並量測管線振動。","textEn":"The line layout drawing should show every bend, anchor design reactions, clamp spacing and shut-off valve location, with the structural engineer confirming that anchors and embeds can take the thrust; at the first high-pressure pour watch the bottom anchor and clamps for movement and measure line vibration.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"管線錨座、管夾預埋件與通過樓板的開口應在結構施工圖中預先設計，而非現場臨時鑽孔；截止閥、洩壓與清管作業須有書面程序，並列為每次高壓泵送前的檢查項目。","textEn":"Design line anchors, clamp embeds and slab openings into the structural shop drawings rather than drilling them ad hoc; give shut-off, pressure relief and line clearing written procedures and include them in the checklist before every high-pressure pour.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「管線佈置、固定與止回」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Line layout, fixing and shut-off\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","管線佈置圖須標示每一個彎管位置、錨座設計反力、管夾間距與截止閥位置，由結構工程師確認錨座與預埋件能承受推力。","坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","The line layout drawing should show every bend, anchor design reactions, clamp spacing and shut-off valve location, with the structural engineer confirming that anchors and embeds can take the thrust.","The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump."],"answer":1,"explanation":"管線佈置圖須標示每一個彎管位置、錨座設計反力、管夾間距與截止閥位置，由結構工程師確認錨座與預埋件能承受推力；首次高壓泵送時觀察底部錨座與管夾是否移位，並量測管線振動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"The line layout drawing should show every bend, anchor design reactions, clamp spacing and shut-off valve location, with the structural engineer confirming that anchors and embeds can take the thrust; at the first high-pressure pour watch the bottom anchor and clamps for movement and measure line vibration. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b069-v13-20","title":"管線佈置、固定與止回：失效診斷","titleEn":"Line layout, fixing and shut-off: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「管線佈置與固定」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Line layout and fixing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"底部彎頭錨座不足，泵送脈動使彎頭逐漸移位，接頭被拉開而爆管；垂直段底部沒有截止閥，停泵時混凝土柱回流，S 閥與活塞受衝擊損壞，甚至造成人員傷害。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An inadequate anchor at the bottom elbow lets pumping pulses move it bit by bit until a coupling pulls apart and bursts; without a shut-off valve at the riser foot, the concrete column flows back when pumping stops, damaging the S-valve and pistons and possibly injuring people. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：管線也必須避開會隨樓層升高而移動的爬模平台。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The line must also clear climbing-form platforms that move up with the building.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"底部彎頭錨座不足，泵送脈動使彎頭逐漸移位，接頭被拉開而爆管；垂直段底部沒有截止閥，停泵時混凝土柱回流，S 閥與活塞受衝擊損壞，甚至造成人員傷害。","textEn":"An inadequate anchor at the bottom elbow lets pumping pulses move it bit by bit until a coupling pulls apart and bursts; without a shut-off valve at the riser foot, the concrete column flows back when pumping stops, damaging the S-valve and pistons and possibly injuring people.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「管線佈置、固定與止回」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Line layout, fixing and shut-off\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","底部彎頭錨座不足，泵送脈動使彎頭逐漸移位，接頭被拉開而爆管；垂直段底部沒有截止閥，停泵時混凝土柱回流，S 閥與活塞受衝擊損壞，甚至造成人員傷害。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","An inadequate anchor at the bottom elbow lets pumping pulses move it bit by bit until a coupling pulls apart and bursts."],"answer":2,"explanation":"底部彎頭錨座不足，泵送脈動使彎頭逐漸移位，接頭被拉開而爆管；垂直段底部沒有截止閥，停泵時混凝土柱回流，S 閥與活塞受衝擊損壞，甚至造成人員傷害。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An inadequate anchor at the bottom elbow lets pumping pulses move it bit by bit until a coupling pulls apart and bursts; without a shut-off valve at the riser foot, the concrete column flows back when pumping stops, damaging the S-valve and pistons and possibly injuring people. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b069-v13-21","title":"開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「開泵與水洗清管」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Start-up and water flushing” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"每次泵送開始前，管線內壁必須先以砂漿或商用潤管劑完整潤滑，否則第一批混凝土會失去漿體而堵管。泵送中最重要的是連續供料：一旦中斷，潤滑層開始脫水，管內混凝土逐漸變硬，重新啟動時壓力急升。超高層管線很長、容積很大，澆置結束後要把管內數立方公尺的混凝土推出並清潔管線；三一重工在超高層專案中以水洗方式把管內混凝土直接推送至澆置點，減少浪費與高空拆管作業。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「開泵與水洗清管」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Before each pour the inside of the line must be fully lubricated with mortar or a commercial primer, or the first concrete loses its paste and blocks the line. During pumping the most important thing is continuous supply: once it stops the lubrication layer starts to dewater, concrete in the line stiffens, and pressure spikes on restart. Supertall lines are long and hold several cubic metres, so at the end of a pour that concrete must be pushed out and the line cleaned; on supertall projects Sany has used water flushing to push the concrete in the line through to the placement point, reducing waste and dismantling of pipes at height. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Start-up and water flushing” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：管線容積 V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³，以 40 m³/h 充滿約需 12.9 min。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Line volume V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³, about 12.9 min to fill at 40 m³/h.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「開泵與水洗清管」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Start-up and water flushing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-21-k1","title":"開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管","titleEn":"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing","text":"每次泵送開始前，管線內壁必須先以砂漿或商用潤管劑完整潤滑，否則第一批混凝土會失去漿體而堵管。泵送中最重要的是連續供料：一旦中斷，潤滑層開始脫水，管內混凝土逐漸變硬，重新啟動時壓力急升。","textEn":"Before each pour the inside of the line must be fully lubricated with mortar or a commercial primer, or the first concrete loses its paste and blocks the line. During pumping the most important thing is continuous supply: once it stops the lubrication layer starts to dewater, concrete in the line stiffens, and pressure spikes on restart.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing\" is correct?","options":["每次泵送開始前，管線內壁必須先以砂漿或商用潤管劑完整潤滑，否則第一批混凝土會失去漿體而堵管。","泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Before each pour the inside of the line must be fully lubricated with mortar or a commercial primer, or the first concrete loses its paste and blocks the line.","Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每次泵送開始前，管線內壁必須先以砂漿或商用潤管劑完整潤滑，否則第一批混凝土會失去漿體而堵管。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Before each pour the inside of the line must be fully lubricated with mortar or a commercial primer, or the first concrete loses its paste and blocks the line. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b069-v13-22","title":"開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管：定量估算","titleEn":"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「開泵與水洗清管」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Start-up and water flushing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：管線容積 V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³，以 40 m³/h 充滿約需 12.9 min。潤管砂漿以 2 mm 厚覆蓋內壁：π×0.125×700×0.002 ≈ 0.55 m³。供料 40 m³/h 時，9 m³ 預拌車需每 13.5 min 到達一車，車次間隔一旦超過約 30 min 即需啟動低速循環或暫停程序。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Line volume V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³, about 12.9 min to fill at 40 m³/h. Priming mortar 2 mm thick on the wall needs π×0.125×700×0.002 ≈ 0.55 m³. At 40 m³/h a 9 m³ truck must arrive every 13.5 min; if the gap exceeds about 30 min, the slow-recirculation or stop procedure starts. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每次泵送記錄潤管材料與數量、首車到達時間、車次間隔、泵壓變化與清管方式；把車次間隔與泵壓尖峰對照，找出供料中斷造成的壓力異常，並與預拌廠檢討派車。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: For each pour record priming material and quantity, first truck arrival, truck intervals, pressure changes and the cleaning method; compare truck gaps with pressure spikes to find supply-related anomalies and review dispatching with the ready-mix plant.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"管線容積 V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³，以 40 m³/h 充滿約需 12.9 min。潤管砂漿以 2 mm 厚覆蓋內壁：π×0.125×700×0.002 ≈ 0.55 m³。供料 40 m³/h 時，9 m³ 預拌車需每 13.5 min 到達一車，車次間隔一旦超過約 30 min 即需啟動低速循環或暫停程序。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Line volume V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³, about 12.9 min to fill at 40 m³/h. Priming mortar 2 mm thick on the wall needs π×0.125×700×0.002 ≈ 0.55 m³. At 40 m³/h a 9 m³ truck must arrive every 13.5 min; if the gap exceeds about 30 min, the slow-recirculation or stop procedure starts. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing\", which statement holds?","options":["管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。","管線容積 V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³，以 40 m³/h 充滿約需 12.9 min。","泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。"],"optionsEn":["If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.","Line volume V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³, about 12.9 min to fill at 40 m³/h.","Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density."],"answer":1,"explanation":"管線容積 V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³，以 40 m³/h 充滿約需 12.9 min。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Line volume V = A·L = 0.0123×700 ≈ 8.6 m³, about 12.9 min to fill at 40 m³/h. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b069-v13-23","title":"開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「開泵與水洗清管」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Start-up and water flushing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每次泵送記錄潤管材料與數量、首車到達時間、車次間隔、泵壓變化與清管方式；把車次間隔與泵壓尖峰對照，找出供料中斷造成的壓力異常，並與預拌廠檢討派車。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"For each pour record priming material and quantity, first truck arrival, truck intervals, pressure changes and the cleaning method; compare truck gaps with pressure spikes to find supply-related anomalies and review dispatching with the ready-mix plant. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：與預拌廠簽訂的供料計畫應包含最大車次間隔、備援車隊與交通尖峰對策；清管程序要規定水洗或球洗方式、管端出口的防護與廢水處理，並明訂只有指定人員可以打開管線。","observationEn":"Site practice: The supply agreement with the ready-mix plant should include the maximum truck interval, a back-up fleet and rush-hour measures; the cleaning procedure should define water or ball flushing, protection at the discharge end and wash-water disposal, and allow only designated people to open the line.","failure":"注意干擾：潤管砂漿不足或與混凝土配比不相容，第一車混凝土在泵機出口附近堵管；尖峰交通造成車次中斷 40 分鐘，重新啟動時壓力過高而爆管，或只能拆管清除已硬化的混凝土。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Too little or incompatible priming mortar lets the first truck block the line near the pump; a 40-minute gap in deliveries during rush hour means restarting at excessive pressure and bursting a pipe, or dismantling the line to clear hardened concrete. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每次泵送記錄潤管材料與數量、首車到達時間、車次間隔、泵壓變化與清管方式；把車次間隔與泵壓尖峰對照，找出供料中斷造成的壓力異常，並與預拌廠檢討派車。","textEn":"For each pour record priming material and quantity, first truck arrival, truck intervals, pressure changes and the cleaning method; compare truck gaps with pressure spikes to find supply-related anomalies and review dispatching with the ready-mix plant.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"與預拌廠簽訂的供料計畫應包含最大車次間隔、備援車隊與交通尖峰對策；清管程序要規定水洗或球洗方式、管端出口的防護與廢水處理，並明訂只有指定人員可以打開管線。","textEn":"The supply agreement with the ready-mix plant should include the maximum truck interval, a back-up fleet and rush-hour measures; the cleaning procedure should define water or ball flushing, protection at the discharge end and wash-water disposal, and allow only designated people to open the line.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。","每次泵送記錄潤管材料與數量、首車到達時間、車次間隔、泵壓變化與清管方式；把車次間隔與泵壓尖峰對照，找出供料中斷造成的壓力異常，並與預拌廠檢討派車。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.","For each pour record priming material and quantity, first truck arrival, truck intervals, pressure changes and the cleaning method."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每次泵送記錄潤管材料與數量、首車到達時間、車次間隔、泵壓變化與清管方式；把車次間隔與泵壓尖峰對照，找出供料中斷造成的壓力異常，並與預拌廠檢討派車。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"For each pour record priming material and quantity, first truck arrival, truck intervals, pressure changes and the cleaning method; compare truck gaps with pressure spikes to find supply-related anomalies and review dispatching with the ready-mix plant. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b069-v13-24","title":"開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管：失效診斷","titleEn":"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「開泵與水洗清管」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Start-up and water flushing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"潤管砂漿不足或與混凝土配比不相容，第一車混凝土在泵機出口附近堵管；尖峰交通造成車次中斷 40 分鐘，重新啟動時壓力過高而爆管，或只能拆管清除已硬化的混凝土。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Too little or incompatible priming mortar lets the first truck block the line near the pump; a 40-minute gap in deliveries during rush hour means restarting at excessive pressure and bursting a pipe, or dismantling the line to clear hardened concrete. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：超高層管線很長、容積很大，澆置結束後要把管內數立方公尺的混凝土推出並清潔管線；三一重工在超高層專案中以水洗方式把管內混凝土直接推送至澆置點，減少浪費與高空拆管作業。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Supertall lines are long and hold several cubic metres, so at the end of a pour that concrete must be pushed out and the line cleaned; on supertall projects Sany has used water flushing to push the concrete in the line through to the placement point, reducing waste and dismantling of pipes at height.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"潤管砂漿不足或與混凝土配比不相容，第一車混凝土在泵機出口附近堵管；尖峰交通造成車次中斷 40 分鐘，重新啟動時壓力過高而爆管，或只能拆管清除已硬化的混凝土。","textEn":"Too little or incompatible priming mortar lets the first truck block the line near the pump; a 40-minute gap in deliveries during rush hour means restarting at excessive pressure and bursting a pipe, or dismantling the line to clear hardened concrete.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「開泵潤管、連續供料與水洗清管」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Priming, continuous supply and water flushing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["潤管砂漿不足或與混凝土配比不相容，第一車混凝土在泵機出口附近堵管；尖峰交通造成車次中斷 40 分鐘，重新啟動時壓力過高而爆管，或只能拆管清除已硬化的混凝土。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Too little or incompatible priming mortar lets the first truck block the line near the pump.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall."],"answer":0,"explanation":"潤管砂漿不足或與混凝土配比不相容，第一車混凝土在泵機出口附近堵管；尖峰交通造成車次中斷 40 分鐘，重新啟動時壓力過高而爆管，或只能拆管清除已硬化的混凝土。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Too little or incompatible priming mortar lets the first truck block the line near the pump; a 40-minute gap in deliveries during rush hour means restarting at excessive pressure and bursting a pipe, or dismantling the line to clear hardened concrete. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b069-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高」與「泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase\" and \"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b069-v13-25","title":"可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「可泵性試驗與試泵」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pumpability tests and trial pumping” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超高層泵送無法只靠配比表判斷可行性，必須在開工前做試驗並在施工中逐步驗證。常見作法是在地面鋪設長水平試驗迴路，量測不同配比在設計流速下的摩擦梯度，再換算到實際高程；也可在施工中隨樓層升高逐步提高泵送高度，累積實測數據。哈里發塔的預拌商 Unimix 在 2007 年先達到 452 m，2008 年再以 BSA 14000 SHP-D 創下 606 m 的垂直泵送紀錄，正是逐步驗證的例子。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「可泵性試驗與試泵」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Supertall pumping feasibility cannot be judged from a mix sheet; it needs tests before work starts and step-by-step verification during construction. A common approach lays a long horizontal test loop at ground level to measure the friction gradient of candidate mixes at design velocity and scale it to the real height; another is to raise pumping height step by step as floors rise, building up measured data. At Burj Khalifa the ready-mix supplier Unimix first reached 452 m in 2007, then set a vertical record of 606 m in 2008 with a BSA 14000 SHP-D, an example of stepwise verification. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pumpability tests and trial pumping” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：試驗迴路上兩個壓力感測器相距 100 m，量到壓差 1.06 MPa，摩擦梯度 i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m；換算到 700 m 實際管線摩擦約 7.4 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Two pressure sensors 100 m apart on a test loop read a difference of 1.06 MPa, so i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m, scaling to about 7.4 MPa of friction on a 700 m line.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「可泵性試驗與試泵」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pumpability tests and trial pumping”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-25-k1","title":"可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高","titleEn":"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase","text":"超高層泵送無法只靠配比表判斷可行性，必須在開工前做試驗並在施工中逐步驗證。常見作法是在地面鋪設長水平試驗迴路，量測不同配比在設計流速下的摩擦梯度，再換算到實際高程；也可在施工中隨樓層升高逐步提高泵送高度，累積實測數據。","textEn":"Supertall pumping feasibility cannot be judged from a mix sheet; it needs tests before work starts and step-by-step verification during construction. A common approach lays a long horizontal test loop at ground level to measure the friction gradient of candidate mixes at design velocity and scale it to the real height; another is to raise pumping height step by step as floors rise, building up measured data.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase\" is correct?","options":["只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。","超高層泵送無法只靠配比表判斷可行性，必須在開工前做試驗並在施工中逐步驗證。","混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall.","Supertall pumping feasibility cannot be judged from a mix sheet; it needs tests before work starts and step-by-step verification during construction.","If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top."],"answer":1,"explanation":"超高層泵送無法只靠配比表判斷可行性，必須在開工前做試驗並在施工中逐步驗證。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Supertall pumping feasibility cannot be judged from a mix sheet; it needs tests before work starts and step-by-step verification during construction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b069-v13-26","title":"可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高：定量估算","titleEn":"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「可泵性試驗與試泵」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pumpability tests and trial pumping” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：試驗迴路上兩個壓力感測器相距 100 m，量到壓差 1.06 MPa，摩擦梯度 i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m；換算到 700 m 實際管線摩擦約 7.4 MPa。但 300 m 長的水平迴路總壓只有約 3.2 MPa，遠低於實際 22 MPa 級，因此迴路試驗是用來校正摩擦參數，不能直接代表高壓下的設備行為。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Two pressure sensors 100 m apart on a test loop read a difference of 1.06 MPa, so i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m, scaling to about 7.4 MPa of friction on a 700 m line. But a 300 m horizontal loop reaches only about 3.2 MPa in total, far below the real 22 MPa class, so loop tests calibrate friction parameters and do not represent equipment behaviour at high pressure. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：試驗計畫列出配比、流速、溫度、感測器位置與允收準則（例如推算泵壓不超過泵機能力的 80%）；施工中每升高一個區段，比較實測泵壓與預測曲線，偏差持續擴大時暫停加高並檢討配比與管線。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: The test plan lists mixes, velocities, temperatures, sensor positions and acceptance criteria, for example predicted pressure no more than 80% of pump capacity; as each height zone is reached, compare measured pressure with the predicted curve and pause the climb in height to review mix and line if the deviation keeps growing.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"試驗迴路上兩個壓力感測器相距 100 m，量到壓差 1.06 MPa，摩擦梯度 i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m；換算到 700 m 實際管線摩擦約 7.4 MPa。但 300 m 長的水平迴路總壓只有約 3.2 MPa，遠低於實際 22 MPa 級，因此迴路試驗是用來校正摩擦參數，不能直接代表高壓下的設備行為。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Two pressure sensors 100 m apart on a test loop read a difference of 1.06 MPa, so i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m, scaling to about 7.4 MPa of friction on a 700 m line. But a 300 m horizontal loop reaches only about 3.2 MPa in total, far below the real 22 MPa class, so loop tests calibrate friction parameters and do not represent equipment behaviour at high pressure. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase\", which statement holds?","options":["只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。","坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。","試驗迴路上兩個壓力感測器相距 100 m，量到壓差 1.06 MPa，摩擦梯度 i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m。"],"optionsEn":["If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed.","The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump.","Two pressure sensors 100 m apart on a test loop read a difference of 1.06 MPa, so i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m, scaling to about 7.4 MPa of friction on a 700 m line."],"answer":2,"explanation":"試驗迴路上兩個壓力感測器相距 100 m，量到壓差 1.06 MPa，摩擦梯度 i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m；換算到 700 m 實際管線摩擦約 7.4 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Two pressure sensors 100 m apart on a test loop read a difference of 1.06 MPa, so i = 1.06/100 = 0.0106 MPa/m, scaling to about 7.4 MPa of friction on a 700 m line. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b069-v13-27","title":"可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「可泵性試驗與試泵」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pumpability tests and trial pumping” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"試驗計畫列出配比、流速、溫度、感測器位置與允收準則（例如推算泵壓不超過泵機能力的 80%）；施工中每升高一個區段，比較實測泵壓與預測曲線，偏差持續擴大時暫停加高並檢討配比與管線。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"The test plan lists mixes, velocities, temperatures, sensor positions and acceptance criteria, for example predicted pressure no more than 80% of pump capacity; as each height zone is reached, compare measured pressure with the predicted curve and pause the climb in height to review mix and line if the deviation keeps growing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把可泵性試驗、逐步加高的壓力紀錄與配比調整列為泵送計畫的必要章節，並在合約中規定混凝土供應商、泵送承包商與總承包商在堵管與配比調整上的責任分界。","observationEn":"Site practice: Make pumpability tests, stepwise pressure records and mix adjustments mandatory chapters of the pumping plan, and set out in the contracts how responsibility for blockages and mix adjustments is divided among the concrete supplier, pumping subcontractor and main contractor.","failure":"注意干擾：只在低樓層試泵合格就假設高樓層也能泵送，接近頂部時泵壓超過設備能力，高強度巨柱混凝土無法送達，只能改用吊斗或降低配比強度，延誤工期並引發設計變更。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Assuming that success on low floors means the top is pumpable lets pressure exceed equipment capacity near the top, so high-strength megacolumn concrete cannot be delivered and the job falls back on skips or a lower-strength mix, delaying the programme and forcing design changes. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"試驗計畫列出配比、流速、溫度、感測器位置與允收準則（例如推算泵壓不超過泵機能力的 80%）；施工中每升高一個區段，比較實測泵壓與預測曲線，偏差持續擴大時暫停加高並檢討配比與管線。","textEn":"The test plan lists mixes, velocities, temperatures, sensor positions and acceptance criteria, for example predicted pressure no more than 80% of pump capacity; as each height zone is reached, compare measured pressure with the predicted curve and pause the climb in height to review mix and line if the deviation keeps growing.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把可泵性試驗、逐步加高的壓力紀錄與配比調整列為泵送計畫的必要章節，並在合約中規定混凝土供應商、泵送承包商與總承包商在堵管與配比調整上的責任分界。","textEn":"Make pumpability tests, stepwise pressure records and mix adjustments mandatory chapters of the pumping plan, and set out in the contracts how responsibility for blockages and mix adjustments is divided among the concrete supplier, pumping subcontractor and main contractor.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase\"?","options":["試驗計畫列出配比、流速、溫度、感測器位置與允收準則（例如推算泵壓不超過泵機能力的 80%）。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。"],"optionsEn":["The test plan lists mixes, velocities, temperatures, sensor positions and acceptance criteria, for example predicted pressure no more than 80% of pump capacity.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"試驗計畫列出配比、流速、溫度、感測器位置與允收準則（例如推算泵壓不超過泵機能力的 80%）；施工中每升高一個區段，比較實測泵壓與預測曲線，偏差持續擴大時暫停加高並檢討配比與管線。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"The test plan lists mixes, velocities, temperatures, sensor positions and acceptance criteria, for example predicted pressure no more than 80% of pump capacity; as each height zone is reached, compare measured pressure with the predicted curve and pause the climb in height to review mix and line if the deviation keeps growing. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b069-v13-28","title":"可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「可泵性試驗與試泵」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pumpability tests and trial pumping” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只在低樓層試泵合格就假設高樓層也能泵送，接近頂部時泵壓超過設備能力，高強度巨柱混凝土無法送達，只能改用吊斗或降低配比強度，延誤工期並引發設計變更。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Assuming that success on low floors means the top is pumpable lets pressure exceed equipment capacity near the top, so high-strength megacolumn concrete cannot be delivered and the job falls back on skips or a lower-strength mix, delaying the programme and forcing design changes. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：哈里發塔的預拌商 Unimix 在 2007 年先達到 452 m，2008 年再以 BSA 14000 SHP-D 創下 606 m 的垂直泵送紀錄，正是逐步驗證的例子。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At Burj Khalifa the ready-mix supplier Unimix first reached 452 m in 2007, then set a vertical record of 606 m in 2008 with a BSA 14000 SHP-D, an example of stepwise verification.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在低樓層試泵合格就假設高樓層也能泵送，接近頂部時泵壓超過設備能力，高強度巨柱混凝土無法送達，只能改用吊斗或降低配比強度，延誤工期並引發設計變更。","textEn":"Assuming that success on low floors means the top is pumpable lets pressure exceed equipment capacity near the top, so high-strength megacolumn concrete cannot be delivered and the job falls back on skips or a lower-strength mix, delaying the programme and forcing design changes.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「可泵性試驗、試驗迴路與逐步加高」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pumpability tests, test loops and stepwise height increase\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只在低樓層試泵合格就假設高樓層也能泵送，接近頂部時泵壓超過設備能力，高強度巨柱混凝土無法送達，只能改用吊斗或降低配比強度，延誤工期並引發設計變更。","混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Assuming that success on low floors means the top is pumpable lets pressure exceed equipment capacity near the top, so high-strength megacolumn concrete cannot be delivered and the job falls back on skips or a lower-strength mix, delaying the programme and forcing design changes.","If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只在低樓層試泵合格就假設高樓層也能泵送，接近頂部時泵壓超過設備能力，高強度巨柱混凝土無法送達，只能改用吊斗或降低配比強度，延誤工期並引發設計變更。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Assuming that success on low floors means the top is pumpable lets pressure exceed equipment capacity near the top, so high-strength megacolumn concrete cannot be delivered and the job falls back on skips or a lower-strength mix, delaying the programme and forcing design changes. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b069-v13-29","title":"泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「坍流度與溫度監測」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超高層混凝土從拌合廠到樓頂需要經過運輸、等候、泵送與布料，總時間可能超過一小時，坍流度會隨時間損失；高溫地區還要面對混凝土溫度過高造成的坍流度快速損失與早凝。泵送本身也會加熱混凝土：克服摩擦的能量大部分轉成熱，使混凝土溫度上升。因此監測不能只在工地入口抽驗，還要在布料機出口取樣，比較泵送前後的坍流度、溫度與含氣量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「坍流度與溫度監測」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Supertall concrete travels from batch plant to roof through haulage, waiting, pumping and placing, possibly for more than an hour, and slump flow is lost with time; in hot regions high concrete temperature accelerates that loss and early stiffening. Pumping itself also heats the concrete: most of the energy spent overcoming friction becomes heat and raises its temperature. Monitoring therefore cannot rely only on sampling at the site gate; samples must also be taken at the boom outlet to compare slump flow, temperature and air content before and after pumping. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：坍流度損失每 30 min 約 30 mm，運輸 60 min 加管內 15 min 共 75 min，損失約 75 mm；出廠 700 mm 到出口約 625 mm，仍高於要求的 600 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Slump flow drops about 30 mm per 30 min; 60 min of haulage plus 15 min in the line is 75 min and about 75 mm of loss, so 700 mm at the plant becomes about 625 mm at the outlet, still above the 600 mm requirement.","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「坍流度與溫度監測」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-29-k1","title":"泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升","titleEn":"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise","text":"超高層混凝土從拌合廠到樓頂需要經過運輸、等候、泵送與布料，總時間可能超過一小時，坍流度會隨時間損失；高溫地區還要面對混凝土溫度過高造成的坍流度快速損失與早凝。泵送本身也會加熱混凝土：克服摩擦的能量大部分轉成熱，使混凝土溫度上升。","textEn":"Supertall concrete travels from batch plant to roof through haulage, waiting, pumping and placing, possibly for more than an hour, and slump flow is lost with time; in hot regions high concrete temperature accelerates that loss and early stiffening. Pumping itself also heats the concrete: most of the energy spent overcoming friction becomes heat and raises its temperature.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise\" is correct?","options":["混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。","管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。","超高層混凝土從拌合廠到樓頂需要經過運輸、等候、泵送與布料，總時間可能超過一小時，坍流度會隨時間損失；高溫地區還要面對混凝土溫度過高造成的坍流度快速損失與早凝。"],"optionsEn":["If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top.","If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.","Supertall concrete travels from batch plant to roof through haulage, waiting, pumping and placing, possibly for more than an hour, and slump flow is lost with time."],"answer":2,"explanation":"超高層混凝土從拌合廠到樓頂需要經過運輸、等候、泵送與布料，總時間可能超過一小時，坍流度會隨時間損失；高溫地區還要面對混凝土溫度過高造成的坍流度快速損失與早凝。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Supertall concrete travels from batch plant to roof through haulage, waiting, pumping and placing, possibly for more than an hour, and slump flow is lost with time; in hot regions high concrete temperature accelerates that loss and early stiffening. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b069-v13-30","title":"泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升：定量估算","titleEn":"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「坍流度與溫度監測」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：坍流度損失每 30 min 約 30 mm，運輸 60 min 加管內 15 min 共 75 min，損失約 75 mm；出廠 700 mm 到出口約 625 mm，仍高於要求的 600 mm。摩擦造成的溫升 ΔT = Δp_friction/(ρc) = (7.4+1.0)×10⁶/(2,450×1,000) ≈ 3.4°C；靜壓部分轉為位能而非熱。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Slump flow drops about 30 mm per 30 min; 60 min of haulage plus 15 min in the line is 75 min and about 75 mm of loss, so 700 mm at the plant becomes about 625 mm at the outlet, still above the 600 mm requirement. Friction heating gives ΔT = Δp_friction/(ρc) = (7.4+1.0)×10⁶/(2,450×1,000) ≈ 3.4°C; the static-head part becomes potential energy, not heat. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在拌合廠、工地入口與布料機出口三處取樣，記錄坍流度、溫度、含氣量與時間戳記，並定期在出口製作強度試體；比較三處數據的變化趨勢，作為調整減水劑、緩凝劑或冷卻措施的依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Sample at the plant, the site gate and the boom outlet, recording slump flow, temperature, air content and time stamps, and periodically cast strength specimens at the outlet; use the trends across the three points to adjust superplasticiser, retarder or cooling measures.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"坍流度損失每 30 min 約 30 mm，運輸 60 min 加管內 15 min 共 75 min，損失約 75 mm；出廠 700 mm 到出口約 625 mm，仍高於要求的 600 mm。摩擦造成的溫升 ΔT = Δp_friction/(ρc) = (7.4+1.0)×10⁶/(2,450×1,000) ≈ 3.4°C；靜壓部分轉為位能而非熱。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Slump flow drops about 30 mm per 30 min; 60 min of haulage plus 15 min in the line is 75 min and about 75 mm of loss, so 700 mm at the plant becomes about 625 mm at the outlet, still above the 600 mm requirement. Friction heating gives ΔT = Δp_friction/(ρc) = (7.4+1.0)×10⁶/(2,450×1,000) ≈ 3.4°C; the static-head part becomes potential energy, not heat. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise\", which statement holds?","options":["坍流度損失每 30 min 約 30 mm，運輸 60 min 加管內 15 min 共 75 min，損失約 75 mm。","泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。","輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Slump flow drops about 30 mm per 30 min.","Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density.","A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping."],"answer":0,"explanation":"坍流度損失每 30 min 約 30 mm，運輸 60 min 加管內 15 min 共 75 min，損失約 75 mm；出廠 700 mm 到出口約 625 mm，仍高於要求的 600 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Slump flow drops about 30 mm per 30 min; 60 min of haulage plus 15 min in the line is 75 min and about 75 mm of loss, so 700 mm at the plant becomes about 625 mm at the outlet, still above the 600 mm requirement. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b069-v13-31","title":"泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「坍流度與溫度監測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在拌合廠、工地入口與布料機出口三處取樣，記錄坍流度、溫度、含氣量與時間戳記，並定期在出口製作強度試體；比較三處數據的變化趨勢，作為調整減水劑、緩凝劑或冷卻措施的依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Sample at the plant, the site gate and the boom outlet, recording slump flow, temperature, air content and time stamps, and periodically cast strength specimens at the outlet; use the trends across the three points to adjust superplasticiser, retarder or cooling measures. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規範中明訂驗收取樣位置為布料機出口，並禁止在現場加水；高溫地區應規定混凝土最高溫度、冷卻措施（冰水、液氮或夜間澆置）與運輸時間上限，並由品管人員在樓頂執行抽驗。","observationEn":"Site practice: Specify the boom outlet as the acceptance sampling point and prohibit adding water on site; in hot climates set a maximum concrete temperature, cooling measures such as chilled water, liquid nitrogen or night pours, and a haul-time limit, with quality staff sampling at the top.","failure":"注意干擾：只在工地入口驗收坍流度，忽略泵送後的損失與溫升，樓頂出口混凝土已變得太稠，工人在現場加水改善流動，強度與耐久性下降；高溫季節未調整澆置時段，泵壓與堵管頻率顯著升高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting slump flow only at the gate while ignoring loss and heating in the line leaves outlet concrete too stiff, and crews add water at the top to make it flow, reducing strength and durability; failing to shift pours to cooler hours in hot seasons markedly raises pump pressure and blockage frequency. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在拌合廠、工地入口與布料機出口三處取樣，記錄坍流度、溫度、含氣量與時間戳記，並定期在出口製作強度試體；比較三處數據的變化趨勢，作為調整減水劑、緩凝劑或冷卻措施的依據。","textEn":"Sample at the plant, the site gate and the boom outlet, recording slump flow, temperature, air content and time stamps, and periodically cast strength specimens at the outlet; use the trends across the three points to adjust superplasticiser, retarder or cooling measures.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規範中明訂驗收取樣位置為布料機出口，並禁止在現場加水；高溫地區應規定混凝土最高溫度、冷卻措施（冰水、液氮或夜間澆置）與運輸時間上限，並由品管人員在樓頂執行抽驗。","textEn":"Specify the boom outlet as the acceptance sampling point and prohibit adding water on site; in hot climates set a maximum concrete temperature, cooling measures such as chilled water, liquid nitrogen or night pours, and a haul-time limit, with quality staff sampling at the top.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在拌合廠、工地入口與布料機出口三處取樣，記錄坍流度、溫度、含氣量與時間戳記，並定期在出口製作強度試體。","垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Sample at the plant, the site gate and the boom outlet, recording slump flow, temperature, air content and time stamps, and periodically cast strength specimens at the outlet.","A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在拌合廠、工地入口與布料機出口三處取樣，記錄坍流度、溫度、含氣量與時間戳記，並定期在出口製作強度試體；比較三處數據的變化趨勢，作為調整減水劑、緩凝劑或冷卻措施的依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Sample at the plant, the site gate and the boom outlet, recording slump flow, temperature, air content and time stamps, and periodically cast strength specimens at the outlet; use the trends across the three points to adjust superplasticiser, retarder or cooling measures. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b069-v13-32","title":"泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「坍流度與溫度監測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Slump-flow and temperature monitoring” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只在工地入口驗收坍流度，忽略泵送後的損失與溫升，樓頂出口混凝土已變得太稠，工人在現場加水改善流動，強度與耐久性下降；高溫季節未調整澆置時段，泵壓與堵管頻率顯著升高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Accepting slump flow only at the gate while ignoring loss and heating in the line leaves outlet concrete too stiff, and crews add water at the top to make it flow, reducing strength and durability; failing to shift pours to cooler hours in hot seasons markedly raises pump pressure and blockage frequency. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此監測不能只在工地入口抽驗，還要在布料機出口取樣，比較泵送前後的坍流度、溫度與含氣量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Monitoring therefore cannot rely only on sampling at the site gate; samples must also be taken at the boom outlet to compare slump flow, temperature and air content before and after pumping.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土在工地入口檢驗合格，泵送到樓頂後的性質也不會改變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If concrete passes inspection at the site gate, its properties will not change after pumping to the top.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只在工地入口驗收坍流度，忽略泵送後的損失與溫升，樓頂出口混凝土已變得太稠，工人在現場加水改善流動，強度與耐久性下降；高溫季節未調整澆置時段，泵壓與堵管頻率顯著升高。","textEn":"Accepting slump flow only at the gate while ignoring loss and heating in the line leaves outlet concrete too stiff, and crews add water at the top to make it flow, reducing strength and durability; failing to shift pours to cooler hours in hot seasons markedly raises pump pressure and blockage frequency.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「泵送監測、坍流度保持與溫度上升」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pumping monitoring, slump-flow retention and temperature rise\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。","只在工地入口驗收坍流度，忽略泵送後的損失與溫升，樓頂出口混凝土已變得太稠，工人在現場加水改善流動，強度與耐久性下降。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.","Accepting slump flow only at the gate while ignoring loss and heating in the line leaves outlet concrete too stiff, and crews add water at the top to make it flow, reducing strength and durability."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只在工地入口驗收坍流度，忽略泵送後的損失與溫升，樓頂出口混凝土已變得太稠，工人在現場加水改善流動，強度與耐久性下降；高溫季節未調整澆置時段，泵壓與堵管頻率顯著升高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting slump flow only at the gate while ignoring loss and heating in the line leaves outlet concrete too stiff, and crews add water at the top to make it flow, reducing strength and durability; failing to shift pours to cooler hours in hot seasons markedly raises pump pressure and blockage frequency. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b069-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機」與「泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing\" and \"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b069-v13-33","title":"磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「管壁超音波測厚」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"高強度混凝土含大量硬質骨材，在高壓下高速通過管線，管壁與彎頭外側持續被磨薄；壁厚一旦降到內壓所需的最小值以下，就可能在最高壓力時爆裂。哈里發塔在 32 個月內泵送約 165,000 m³ 混凝土，這樣的累積量足以讓高磨耗位置的管件經歷數次更換。因此管線管理要以泵送量而不只以時間追蹤磨耗，並以測厚數據決定更換，而不是等到漏漿或破裂。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「管壁超音波測厚」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"High-strength concrete carries plenty of hard aggregate through the line at high pressure, so pipe walls and the outside of elbows are continuously worn thinner; once the wall falls below the minimum needed for internal pressure, it can burst at peak pressure. Burj Khalifa pumped about 165,000 m³ of concrete over 32 months, enough for high-wear components to be replaced several times. Line management must therefore track wear against pumped volume, not just time, and replace parts on thickness data rather than waiting for leaks or ruptures. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：新管壁厚 10 mm、最小所需 5.6 mm，磨耗裕度 4.4 mm；若直管磨耗率 0.05 mm/1,000 m³，壽命約 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³；彎頭外側磨耗約為 3 倍，壽命約 29,000 m³。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: New walls are 10 mm with 5.6 mm required, a 4.4 mm wear allowance; at 0.05 mm per 1,000 m³ for straight pipe, life is about 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³, while the outside of an elbow wears about three times faster, giving about 29,000 m³.","failure":"常見誤解：「管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「管壁超音波測厚」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-33-k1","title":"磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機","titleEn":"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing","text":"高強度混凝土含大量硬質骨材，在高壓下高速通過管線，管壁與彎頭外側持續被磨薄；壁厚一旦降到內壓所需的最小值以下，就可能在最高壓力時爆裂。哈里發塔在 32 個月內泵送約 165,000 m³ 混凝土，這樣的累積量足以讓高磨耗位置的管件經歷數次更換。","textEn":"High-strength concrete carries plenty of hard aggregate through the line at high pressure, so pipe walls and the outside of elbows are continuously worn thinner; once the wall falls below the minimum needed for internal pressure, it can burst at peak pressure. Burj Khalifa pumped about 165,000 m³ of concrete over 32 months, enough for high-wear components to be replaced several times.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing\" is correct?","options":["高強度混凝土含大量硬質骨材，在高壓下高速通過管線，管壁與彎頭外側持續被磨薄；壁厚一旦降到內壓所需的最小值以下，就可能在最高壓力時爆裂。","管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。","只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。"],"optionsEn":["High-strength concrete carries plenty of hard aggregate through the line at high pressure, so pipe walls and the outside of elbows are continuously worn thinner.","If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.","If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"高強度混凝土含大量硬質骨材，在高壓下高速通過管線，管壁與彎頭外側持續被磨薄；壁厚一旦降到內壓所需的最小值以下，就可能在最高壓力時爆裂。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"High-strength concrete carries plenty of hard aggregate through the line at high pressure, so pipe walls and the outside of elbows are continuously worn thinner; once the wall falls below the minimum needed for internal pressure, it can burst at peak pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b069-v13-34","title":"磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機：定量估算","titleEn":"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「管壁超音波測厚」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：新管壁厚 10 mm、最小所需 5.6 mm，磨耗裕度 4.4 mm；若直管磨耗率 0.05 mm/1,000 m³，壽命約 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³；彎頭外側磨耗約為 3 倍，壽命約 29,000 m³。以 165,000 m³ 的總量計，直管至少更換一次，彎頭約需更換 5 次。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: New walls are 10 mm with 5.6 mm required, a 4.4 mm wear allowance; at 0.05 mm per 1,000 m³ for straight pipe, life is about 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³, while the outside of an elbow wears about three times faster, giving about 29,000 m³. Over 165,000 m³, straight pipes need at least one replacement and elbows about five. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以超音波測厚儀在每根管與彎頭的固定測點定期量測，量測頻率依累積泵送量設定（例如每 5,000 m³ 一次），把讀值畫成厚度對泵送量的曲線預測更換時點；接近最小厚度的管件標示並排入更換。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure every pipe and elbow at fixed points with an ultrasonic gauge at intervals set by pumped volume, for example every 5,000 m³, plot thickness against volume to forecast replacement, and tag and schedule replacement for parts approaching the minimum thickness.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"新管壁厚 10 mm、最小所需 5.6 mm，磨耗裕度 4.4 mm；若直管磨耗率 0.05 mm/1,000 m³，壽命約 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³；彎頭外側磨耗約為 3 倍，壽命約 29,000 m³。以 165,000 m³ 的總量計，直管至少更換一次，彎頭約需更換 5 次。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"New walls are 10 mm with 5.6 mm required, a 4.4 mm wear allowance; at 0.05 mm per 1,000 m³ for straight pipe, life is about 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³, while the outside of an elbow wears about three times faster, giving about 29,000 m³. Over 165,000 m³, straight pipes need at least one replacement and elbows about five. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing\", which statement holds?","options":["坍流度越大的混凝土就一定越容易泵送。","新管壁厚 10 mm、最小所需 5.6 mm，磨耗裕度 4.4 mm。","泵機的最大排量和最大壓力可以同時達到。"],"optionsEn":["The higher the slump flow, the easier the concrete is to pump.","New walls are 10 mm with 5.6 mm required, a 4.4 mm wear allowance.","A pump can reach its maximum output and its maximum pressure at the same time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"新管壁厚 10 mm、最小所需 5.6 mm，磨耗裕度 4.4 mm；若直管磨耗率 0.05 mm/1,000 m³，壽命約 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³；彎頭外側磨耗約為 3 倍，壽命約 29,000 m³。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"New walls are 10 mm with 5.6 mm required, a 4.4 mm wear allowance; at 0.05 mm per 1,000 m³ for straight pipe, life is about 4.4/0.05×1,000 = 88,000 m³, while the outside of an elbow wears about three times faster, giving about 29,000 m³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b069-v13-35","title":"磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管壁超音波測厚」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以超音波測厚儀在每根管與彎頭的固定測點定期量測，量測頻率依累積泵送量設定（例如每 5,000 m³ 一次），把讀值畫成厚度對泵送量的曲線預測更換時點；接近最小厚度的管件標示並排入更換。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure every pipe and elbow at fixed points with an ultrasonic gauge at intervals set by pumped volume, for example every 5,000 m³, plot thickness against volume to forecast replacement, and tag and schedule replacement for parts approaching the minimum thickness. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：管線維護計畫應包含測點位置圖、量測頻率、最小厚度、更換程序與備品數量；更換作業須先釋壓並確認截止閥關閉，由指定人員執行並記錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: The line maintenance plan should include measuring-point drawings, frequency, minimum thickness, replacement procedure and spare quantities; replacements must follow pressure relief and confirmed shut-off, carried out and recorded by designated staff.","failure":"注意干擾：未建立測厚制度，以外觀判斷管件狀況，彎頭在高壓段突然破裂，混凝土與碎片噴出，泵送中斷並造成冷縫；更換管件時未分辨壓力等級，把低壓管裝到高壓段。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without a thickness programme and judging pipes by appearance, an elbow in the high-pressure zone suddenly ruptures, spraying concrete and fragments, stopping the pour and leaving a cold joint; replacing parts without checking pressure grade puts low-pressure pipe into a high-pressure zone. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以超音波測厚儀在每根管與彎頭的固定測點定期量測，量測頻率依累積泵送量設定（例如每 5,000 m³ 一次），把讀值畫成厚度對泵送量的曲線預測更換時點；接近最小厚度的管件標示並排入更換。","textEn":"Measure every pipe and elbow at fixed points with an ultrasonic gauge at intervals set by pumped volume, for example every 5,000 m³, plot thickness against volume to forecast replacement, and tag and schedule replacement for parts approaching the minimum thickness.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"管線維護計畫應包含測點位置圖、量測頻率、最小厚度、更換程序與備品數量；更換作業須先釋壓並確認截止閥關閉，由指定人員執行並記錄。","textEn":"The line maintenance plan should include measuring-point drawings, frequency, minimum thickness, replacement procedure and spare quantities; replacements must follow pressure relief and confirmed shut-off, carried out and recorded by designated staff.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","泵送中途停一下沒關係，混凝土還沒凝結，隨時可以再開泵。","以超音波測厚儀在每根管與彎頭的固定測點定期量測，量測頻率依累積泵送量設定（例如每 5,000 m³ 一次），把讀值畫成厚度對泵送量的曲線預測更換時點。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Pausing mid-pour is harmless because the concrete has not set and pumping can resume at any time.","Measure every pipe and elbow at fixed points with an ultrasonic gauge at intervals set by pumped volume, for example every 5,000 m³, plot thickness against volume to forecast replacement, and tag and schedule replacement for parts approaching the minimum thickness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以超音波測厚儀在每根管與彎頭的固定測點定期量測，量測頻率依累積泵送量設定（例如每 5,000 m³ 一次），把讀值畫成厚度對泵送量的曲線預測更換時點；接近最小厚度的管件標示並排入更換。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure every pipe and elbow at fixed points with an ultrasonic gauge at intervals set by pumped volume, for example every 5,000 m³, plot thickness against volume to forecast replacement, and tag and schedule replacement for parts approaching the minimum thickness. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b069-v13-36","title":"磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「管壁超音波測厚」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ultrasonic pipe-wall thickness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"未建立測厚制度，以外觀判斷管件狀況，彎頭在高壓段突然破裂，混凝土與碎片噴出，泵送中斷並造成冷縫；更換管件時未分辨壓力等級，把低壓管裝到高壓段。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without a thickness programme and judging pipes by appearance, an elbow in the high-pressure zone suddenly ruptures, spraying concrete and fragments, stopping the pour and leaving a cold joint; replacing parts without checking pressure grade puts low-pressure pipe into a high-pressure zone. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此管線管理要以泵送量而不只以時間追蹤磨耗，並以測厚數據決定更換，而不是等到漏漿或破裂。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Line management must therefore track wear against pumped volume, not just time, and replace parts on thickness data rather than waiting for leaks or ruptures.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「管線外觀沒有漏漿或變形，就表示管壁厚度足夠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the line shows no leaks or deformation, the walls must still be thick enough.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"未建立測厚制度，以外觀判斷管件狀況，彎頭在高壓段突然破裂，混凝土與碎片噴出，泵送中斷並造成冷縫；更換管件時未分辨壓力等級，把低壓管裝到高壓段。","textEn":"Without a thickness programme and judging pipes by appearance, an elbow in the high-pressure zone suddenly ruptures, spraying concrete and fragments, stopping the pour and leaving a cold joint; replacing parts without checking pressure grade puts low-pressure pipe into a high-pressure zone.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「磨耗監測、爆管風險與更換時機」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wear monitoring, burst risk and replacement timing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["未建立測厚制度，以外觀判斷管件狀況，彎頭在高壓段突然破裂，混凝土與碎片噴出，泵送中斷並造成冷縫；更換管件時未分辨壓力等級，把低壓管裝到高壓段。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。"],"optionsEn":["Without a thickness programme and judging pipes by appearance, an elbow in the high-pressure zone suddenly ruptures, spraying concrete and fragments, stopping the pour and leaving a cold joint.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"未建立測厚制度，以外觀判斷管件狀況，彎頭在高壓段突然破裂，混凝土與碎片噴出，泵送中斷並造成冷縫；更換管件時未分辨壓力等級，把低壓管裝到高壓段。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without a thickness programme and judging pipes by appearance, an elbow in the high-pressure zone suddenly ruptures, spraying concrete and fragments, stopping the pour and leaving a cold joint; replacing parts without checking pressure grade puts low-pressure pipe into a high-pressure zone. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b069-v13-37","title":"泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」如何影響高強度混凝土高程泵送的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pumping records and strength traceability” governs force, deformation or durability in “High-elevation pumping of high-strength concrete”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"超高層的混凝土強度等級常隨高度分區變化，例如下部核心筒與巨柱使用最高等級，上部逐漸降低；平安金融中心在 2014 年封頂時以 C100 高強度混凝土泵送到 555.5 m。泵送管線中可能同時有前後兩種等級的混凝土，換料時的界面處理與澆置位置必須記錄清楚。交接時需要的不只是強度報告，而是每一次澆置的位置、等級、車次、泵壓、出口取樣結果與任何異常，讓日後鑽心或改修時可以追溯到當時的材料與條件。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Supertall concrete grades often change by height zone, the highest grade in lower cores and megacolumns and lower grades above; at Ping An Finance Center C100 high-strength concrete was pumped to 555.5 m at core top-out in 2014. A line may hold two grades in sequence, so the interface during a changeover and where it was placed must be recorded. Handover needs more than strength reports: it needs each pour's location, grade, truck numbers, pump pressure, outlet sampling results and any anomalies, so that future coring or alterations can be traced back to the materials and conditions at the time. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Pumping records and strength traceability” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以每 150 yd³（約 115 m³）至少一組強度試驗的頻率計，165,000 m³ 的泵送量至少需 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 組試驗。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At no less than one strength test per 150 yd³ (about 115 m³), 165,000 m³ of pumped concrete needs at least 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 tests.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Pumping records and strength traceability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-37-k1","title":"泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接","titleEn":"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover","text":"超高層的混凝土強度等級常隨高度分區變化，例如下部核心筒與巨柱使用最高等級，上部逐漸降低；平安金融中心在 2014 年封頂時以 C100 高強度混凝土泵送到 555.5 m。泵送管線中可能同時有前後兩種等級的混凝土，換料時的界面處理與澆置位置必須記錄清楚。","textEn":"Supertall concrete grades often change by height zone, the highest grade in lower cores and megacolumns and lower grades above; at Ping An Finance Center C100 high-strength concrete was pumped to 555.5 m at core top-out in 2014. A line may hold two grades in sequence, so the interface during a changeover and where it was placed must be recorded.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover\" is correct?","options":["只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。","超高層的混凝土強度等級常隨高度分區變化，例如下部核心筒與巨柱使用最高等級，上部逐漸降低。","泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。"],"optionsEn":["If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed.","Supertall concrete grades often change by height zone, the highest grade in lower cores and megacolumns and lower grades above.","Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density."],"answer":1,"explanation":"超高層的混凝土強度等級常隨高度分區變化，例如下部核心筒與巨柱使用最高等級，上部逐漸降低；平安金融中心在 2014 年封頂時以 C100 高強度混凝土泵送到 555.5 m。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Supertall concrete grades often change by height zone, the highest grade in lower cores and megacolumns and lower grades above; at Ping An Finance Center C100 high-strength concrete was pumped to 555.5 m at core top-out in 2014. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b069-v13-38","title":"泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pumping records and strength traceability” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以每 150 yd³（約 115 m³）至少一組強度試驗的頻率計，165,000 m³ 的泵送量至少需 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 組試驗。若某一澆置區段的出口試體平均強度比入口低 3 MPa 以上，即標記為需調查的批次。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At no less than one strength test per 150 yd³ (about 115 m³), 165,000 m³ of pumped concrete needs at least 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 tests. If outlet specimens in a pour zone average more than 3 MPa below gate specimens, that batch is flagged for investigation. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以澆置紀錄資料庫把每一車次對應到樓層與構件位置，將強度試驗結果、泵壓紀錄與出口取樣連結；交接前抽查資料庫完整性，確認每一個高強度區段都有對應的試驗與追溯資料。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Link each truck to floor and member location in a pour-record database, tied to strength results, pump-pressure logs and outlet samples; before handover audit the database for completeness and confirm that every high-strength zone has matching tests and traceability.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以每 150 yd³（約 115 m³）至少一組強度試驗的頻率計，165,000 m³ 的泵送量至少需 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 組試驗。若某一澆置區段的出口試體平均強度比入口低 3 MPa 以上，即標記為需調查的批次。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"At no less than one strength test per 150 yd³ (about 115 m³), 165,000 m³ of pumped concrete needs at least 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 tests. If outlet specimens in a pour zone average more than 3 MPa below gate specimens, that batch is flagged for investigation. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["輸送管只是管子，任何鋼管只要接得上就能用於超高層泵送。","垂直泵送管只要綁在牆上不會掉下來就可以，不需要計算推力。","以每 150 yd³（約 115 m³）至少一組強度試驗的頻率計，165,000 m³ 的泵送量至少需 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 組試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A pump line is just pipe, so any steel pipe that fits can be used for supertall pumping.","A vertical pump line only needs tying to the wall so it does not fall; no thrust calculation is required.","At no less than one strength test per 150 yd³ (about 115 m³), 165,000 m³ of pumped concrete needs at least 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 tests."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以每 150 yd³（約 115 m³）至少一組強度試驗的頻率計，165,000 m³ 的泵送量至少需 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 組試驗。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At no less than one strength test per 150 yd³ (about 115 m³), 165,000 m³ of pumped concrete needs at least 165,000/114.7 ≈ 1,439 tests. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b069-v13-39","title":"泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pumping records and strength traceability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以澆置紀錄資料庫把每一車次對應到樓層與構件位置，將強度試驗結果、泵壓紀錄與出口取樣連結；交接前抽查資料庫完整性，確認每一個高強度區段都有對應的試驗與追溯資料。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Link each truck to floor and member location in a pour-record database, tied to strength results, pump-pressure logs and outlet samples; before handover audit the database for completeness and confirm that every high-strength zone has matching tests and traceability. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：換料程序要規定界面混凝土的處理方式（例如先澆到較低等級的構件或棄置），並由現場工程師簽記；交接文件應包含可搜尋的澆置資料庫、強度統計、泵送紀錄與異常處理報告，作為維護與改修的依據。","observationEn":"Site practice: The grade-change procedure should define how interface concrete is handled, for example placing it in a lower-grade member or discarding it, signed off by the site engineer; handover should include a searchable pour database, strength statistics, pumping logs and nonconformance reports as the basis for maintenance and alterations.","failure":"注意干擾：換料時未清楚分隔不同等級，低強度混凝土被誤澆到巨柱的高強度區段，事後只能大量鑽心檢驗甚至補強；紀錄只保存紙本且未對應位置，多年後改修時無法確認某處的實際強度等級。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without clear separation at a grade change, lower-strength concrete is placed by mistake in a high-strength megacolumn zone, forcing extensive coring or even strengthening; records kept only on paper and not tied to locations leave later alterations unable to confirm the real grade at a given spot. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以澆置紀錄資料庫把每一車次對應到樓層與構件位置，將強度試驗結果、泵壓紀錄與出口取樣連結；交接前抽查資料庫完整性，確認每一個高強度區段都有對應的試驗與追溯資料。","textEn":"Link each truck to floor and member location in a pour-record database, tied to strength results, pump-pressure logs and outlet samples; before handover audit the database for completeness and confirm that every high-strength zone has matching tests and traceability.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"換料程序要規定界面混凝土的處理方式（例如先澆到較低等級的構件或棄置），並由現場工程師簽記；交接文件應包含可搜尋的澆置資料庫、強度統計、泵送紀錄與異常處理報告，作為維護與改修的依據。","textEn":"The grade-change procedure should define how interface concrete is handled, for example placing it in a lower-grade member or discarding it, signed off by the site engineer; handover should include a searchable pour database, strength statistics, pumping logs and nonconformance reports as the basis for maintenance and alterations.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover\"?","options":["以澆置紀錄資料庫把每一車次對應到樓層與構件位置，將強度試驗結果、泵壓紀錄與出口取樣連結；交接前抽查資料庫完整性，確認每一個高強度區段都有對應的試驗與追溯資料。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要在地面試泵一次成功，整棟超高層都可以用同一配比泵送。"],"optionsEn":["Link each truck to floor and member location in a pour-record database, tied to strength results, pump-pressure logs and outlet samples.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","One successful trial at ground level means the same mix can be pumped to the top of a supertall."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以澆置紀錄資料庫把每一車次對應到樓層與構件位置，將強度試驗結果、泵壓紀錄與出口取樣連結；交接前抽查資料庫完整性，確認每一個高強度區段都有對應的試驗與追溯資料。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Link each truck to floor and member location in a pour-record database, tied to strength results, pump-pressure logs and outlet samples; before handover audit the database for completeness and confirm that every high-strength zone has matching tests and traceability. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b069-v13-40","title":"泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"prerequisiteIds":["b069-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「泵送紀錄與強度追溯」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pumping records and strength traceability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"換料時未清楚分隔不同等級，低強度混凝土被誤澆到巨柱的高強度區段，事後只能大量鑽心檢驗甚至補強；紀錄只保存紙本且未對應位置，多年後改修時無法確認某處的實際強度等級。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without clear separation at a grade change, lower-strength concrete is placed by mistake in a high-strength megacolumn zone, forcing extensive coring or even strengthening; records kept only on paper and not tied to locations leave later alterations unable to confirm the real grade at a given spot. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：交接時需要的不只是強度報告，而是每一次澆置的位置、等級、車次、泵壓、出口取樣結果與任何異常，讓日後鑽心或改修時可以追溯到當時的材料與條件。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover needs more than strength reports: it needs each pour's location, grade, truck numbers, pump pressure, outlet sampling results and any anomalies, so that future coring or alterations can be traced back to the materials and conditions at the time.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要強度試驗平均值合格，就不需要記錄每一車混凝土澆在哪裡。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the average strength passes, there is no need to record where each truck was placed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b069-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"換料時未清楚分隔不同等級，低強度混凝土被誤澆到巨柱的高強度區段，事後只能大量鑽心檢驗甚至補強；紀錄只保存紙本且未對應位置，多年後改修時無法確認某處的實際強度等級。","textEn":"Without clear separation at a grade change, lower-strength concrete is placed by mistake in a high-strength megacolumn zone, forcing extensive coring or even strengthening; records kept only on paper and not tied to locations leave later alterations unable to confirm the real grade at a given spot.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]},{"id":"b069-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「泵送紀錄、強度追溯與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pumping records, strength traceability and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","換料時未清楚分隔不同等級，低強度混凝土被誤澆到巨柱的高強度區段，事後只能大量鑽心檢驗甚至補強。","泵送高度只要乘上混凝土密度就能算出所需泵壓。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Without clear separation at a grade change, lower-strength concrete is placed by mistake in a high-strength megacolumn zone, forcing extensive coring or even strengthening.","Pump pressure can be found simply by multiplying height by concrete density."],"answer":1,"explanation":"換料時未清楚分隔不同等級，低強度混凝土被誤澆到巨柱的高強度區段，事後只能大量鑽心檢驗甚至補強；紀錄只保存紙本且未對應位置，多年後改修時無法確認某處的實際強度等級。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without clear separation at a grade change, lower-strength concrete is placed by mistake in a high-strength megacolumn zone, forcing extensive coring or even strengthening; records kept only on paper and not tied to locations leave later alterations unable to confirm the real grade at a given spot. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-putzmeister-burj-khalifa","v13s-sany-pump-king-release","v13s-aci-304-2r-17","v13s-mecn-sany-shanghai"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
